(849903, 96063, 21554, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote because I''m not a member yet, but this is a marvellously evocative picture.  If I could vote, you''d have my ten.</td>', 'I can''t vote because I''m not a member yet, but this is a marvellously evocative picture.  If I could vote, you''d have my ten.', '2004-08-09 01:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(849914, 96569, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an example, IMO, of where selective desaturation does not work.  Selective desaturation is generally used to put a viewer''s focus on part of the image... usually the subject of the image.  Is the board/wood in this photo where you want your viewer to focus?</td>', 'This is an example, IMO, of where selective desaturation does not work.  Selective desaturation is generally used to put a viewer''s focus on part of the image... usually the subject of the image.  Is the board/wood in this photo where you want your viewer to focus?', '2004-08-09 01:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
