(850176, 96407, 9747, '<td valign="top">This got a chuckle out of me! Overall composition is a bit busy, it''d be cool if the floor and the stall sides are white (or just the floor being white) - that would help bring the attention to the feet more. Just my 2 cents. Good shot, hope you didn''t get any weird looks from whoever may be in the room. ;-)</td>', 'This got a chuckle out of me! Overall composition is a bit busy, it''d be cool if the floor and the stall sides are white (or just the floor being white) - that would help bring the attention to the feet more. Just my 2 cents. Good shot, hope you didn''t get any weird looks from whoever may be in the room. ;-)', '2004-08-09 02:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
