(850544, 96492, 16493, '<td valign="top">very funny</td>', 'very funny', '2004-08-09 10:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(850567, 96522, 5822, '<td valign="top">Composition is very good and I like the b&amp;w, as well as, the grainy appearance. Gives the impression of a hard days work and on her feet for a long time  I think that the lighting should be more on her feet and shoes, and less on her thighs. DOF is good and I like the way the shoes are blurred, but think it would have been better with more light on the feet and shoes. Also, would have preferred had the woman not been wearing stockings.</td>', 'Composition is very good and I like the b&w, as well as, the grainy appearance. Gives the impression of a hard days work and on her feet for a long time  I think that the lighting should be more on her feet and shoes, and less on her thighs. DOF is good and I like the way the shoes are blurred, but think it would have been better with more light on the feet and shoes. Also, would have preferred had the woman not been wearing stockings.', '2004-08-09 11:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(850573, 95368, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the b&amp;w toning and the pattern of the cobbleed road.  Silhouette is also very effective, but I think the main subject and issue with this image is not the feet, but just looking at it I ask myself why the top of the torso and head have been cut off, so that lack of a whole body distract from what should be the main subjects.</td>', 'I love the b&w toning and the pattern of the cobbleed road.  Silhouette is also very effective, but I think the main subject and issue with this image is not the feet, but just looking at it I ask myself why the top of the torso and head have been cut off, so that lack of a whole body distract from what should be the main subjects.', '2004-08-09 11:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(850576, 96223, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich and saturated colors and I love the texture of the fur!  DOF is fantastic as well and really helps to isolate the bear. Perhaps some fill light to help illuminate the paw? Great job overall. High score.</td>', 'Beautiful rich and saturated colors and I love the texture of the fur!  DOF is fantastic as well and really helps to isolate the bear. Perhaps some fill light to help illuminate the paw? Great job overall. High score.', '2004-08-09 11:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(850581, 96465, 5822, '<td valign="top">Some blown out areas on the feet from perhaps too long of shutter speed? I don''t find the composition all that compelling.</td>', 'Some blown out areas on the feet from perhaps too long of shutter speed? I don''t find the composition all that compelling.', '2004-08-09 11:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(850582, 96608, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautifully crisp and clear focus with excellent sepia toning. Contrast is very appealing and the highlights of the of the shoes help to focus attention on that part of the pic even though they are blurred by movement.  DOF is excellent.</td>', 'Beautifully crisp and clear focus with excellent sepia toning. Contrast is very appealing and the highlights of the of the shoes help to focus attention on that part of the pic even though they are blurred by movement.  DOF is excellent.', '2004-08-09 11:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(850588, 96348, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the concept for this image, but find the lighting too harsh and don''t like the effect of the selective desaturation or the color of the blue water...looks too unreal.  The harsh lighting makes for a few hot spots.  The fawcet is very interesting too look at without the selective desaturation and had you used softer lighting I think you would have had a very good image. Also, watch out for small distractions such as the shower curtain in the lower right hand corner.</td>', 'I like the concept for this image, but find the lighting too harsh and don''t like the effect of the selective desaturation or the color of the blue water...looks too unreal.  The harsh lighting makes for a few hot spots.  The fawcet is very interesting too look at without the selective desaturation and had you used softer lighting I think you would have had a very good image. Also, watch out for small distractions such as the shower curtain in the lower right hand corner.', '2004-08-09 11:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(850591, 96317, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery but I think you''re angle of view is too common and not very unique. Sand on your feet is too distracting as well.</td>', 'Beautiful scenery but I think you''re angle of view is too common and not very unique. Sand on your feet is too distracting as well.', '2004-08-09 11:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
