(850652, 95895, 25065, '<td valign="top">Good spash, nice pic, though a little too dark (Mud''s fault, not yours) Too much shadow on/around the feet.</td>', 'Good spash, nice pic, though a little too dark (Mud''s fault, not yours) Too much shadow on/around the feet.', '2004-08-09 12:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(850654, 96397, 25065, '<td valign="top">Freaky subject, Great picture</td>', 'Freaky subject, Great picture', '2004-08-09 12:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(850657, 96556, 17851, '<td valign="top">My favorite from the challenge!!, lighting is great, and the photo is very interesting. Good Luck, 10</td>', 'My favorite from the challenge!!, lighting is great, and the photo is very interesting. Good Luck, 10', '2004-08-09 12:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(850658, 96505, 21606, '<td valign="top">I love the motion of the road, yet stillness of the rider. This is an excellent photo!</td>', 'I love the motion of the road, yet stillness of the rider. This is an excellent photo!', '2004-08-09 12:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(850662, 96584, 21606, '<td valign="top">The shadows and lines on the dock add a special touch to this photo, and the red adds flare to the images whole.</td>', 'The shadows and lines on the dock add a special touch to this photo, and the red adds flare to the images whole.', '2004-08-09 12:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(850664, 96459, 18197, '<td valign="top">THAT made me smile.</td>', 'THAT made me smile.', '2004-08-09 12:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(850665, 95827, 21606, '<td valign="top">The downward perspective on the shoes intrigue the thought that this person is looking down at their new challenge in life. I like it.</td>', 'The downward perspective on the shoes intrigue the thought that this person is looking down at their new challenge in life. I like it.', '2004-08-09 12:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(850666, 96449, 18197, '<td valign="top">Bigger, please. Otherwise other fine images will be under appreciated.</td>', 'Bigger, please. Otherwise other fine images will be under appreciated.', '2004-08-09 12:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(850668, 96292, 21606, '<td valign="top">After a hard days work I find myself doing this too. There is wonderful lighting and contrast in this photo, keep up the good work in challenges to come.</td>', 'After a hard days work I find myself doing this too. There is wonderful lighting and contrast in this photo, keep up the good work in challenges to come.', '2004-08-09 12:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(850669, 95556, 18197, '<td valign="top">Bigger, please.</td>', 'Bigger, please.', '2004-08-09 12:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(850675, 96256, 21606, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. You have done exactly what the challenge asked; you captured the feet. And while most everyone else cropped to just the feet, you creatively have only those cute paws in focus. Beautiful image. My Girlfriend would love it.</td>', 'This is wonderful. You have done exactly what the challenge asked; you captured the feet. And while most everyone else cropped to just the feet, you creatively have only those cute paws in focus. Beautiful image. My Girlfriend would love it.', '2004-08-09 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(850692, 96549, 8643, '<td valign="top">This was a neat idea, pity the left foot is not clear at the toes - maybe a bit more light would have helped too.  Nevertheless one of the best for me!</td>', 'This was a neat idea, pity the left foot is not clear at the toes - maybe a bit more light would have helped too.  Nevertheless one of the best for me!', '2004-08-09 12:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(850695, 96430, 25065, '<td valign="top">This picture Socks! (J/K, Good Photo, #3 needs new socks)</td>', 'This picture Socks! (J/K, Good Photo, #3 needs new socks)', '2004-08-09 12:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(850698, 96022, 25065, '<td valign="top">Apparently they do. Pretty Good pic, though the distance from shoes to Flowers is way too much. It becomes less a matter of suspense and more a matter of scroll annoyance at this point.  And be prepared for the people who will not like it just because you set a couple of plants on fire.</td>', 'Apparently they do. Pretty Good pic, though the distance from shoes to Flowers is way too much. It becomes less a matter of suspense and more a matter of scroll annoyance at this point.  And be prepared for the people who will not like it just because you set a couple of plants on fire.', '2004-08-09 12:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(850701, 96475, 25065, '<td valign="top">I''m Blind! Too Much light. Great idea, but just too bright, it overpowers all the feet.</td>', 'I''m Blind! Too Much light. Great idea, but just too bright, it overpowers all the feet.', '2004-08-09 12:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(850702, 96457, 18197, '<td valign="top">Terrific image. Like the desat. Like the unconventional frame (although risky). Selective soft focus is nice too. Hope it does well.</td>', 'Terrific image. Like the desat. Like the unconventional frame (although risky). Selective soft focus is nice too. Hope it does well.', '2004-08-09 12:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(850704, 96562, 25065, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! Hilarious title to go with a great picture. Next time ask the Flamingo to stand on dry land for you...(J/K)</td>', 'Fantastic! Hilarious title to go with a great picture. Next time ask the Flamingo to stand on dry land for you...(J/K)', '2004-08-09 12:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(850708, 96338, 25065, '<td valign="top">Well-done picture with a Jeffrey Dahmer twist. You''ll lose points with some people for such a macabre image, but not with me! Too bad I can''t vote on it...</td>', 'Well-done picture with a Jeffrey Dahmer twist. You''ll lose points with some people for such a macabre image, but not with me! Too bad I can''t vote on it...', '2004-08-09 12:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(850710, 96492, 5286, '<td valign="top">Lots of points for making me laugh early in the morning :)</td>', 'Lots of points for making me laugh early in the morning :)', '2004-08-09 12:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(850712, 96556, 5286, '<td valign="top">The background is great.. but not the back of the feet ..</td>', 'The background is great.. but not the back of the feet ..', '2004-08-09 12:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(850716, 96523, 25065, '<td valign="top">Awww, very cute. Great DoF, but the longhair''s feet  kinda blend into the rest of it, not your fault, though.</td>', 'Awww, very cute. Great DoF, but the longhair''s feet  kinda blend into the rest of it, not your fault, though.', '2004-08-09 12:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(850720, 96556, 25065, '<td valign="top">Good pic, love the dark background, are those feet Diseased? Or just dirty?</td>', 'Good pic, love the dark background, are those feet Diseased? Or just dirty?', '2004-08-09 12:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(850722, 96449, 25065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Bet he plays one hell of an interesting game of "patty-cake"...</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Bet he plays one hell of an interesting game of "patty-cake"...', '2004-08-09 12:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(850726, 96582, 5286, '<td valign="top"><br/></td>', '', '2004-08-09 12:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(850727, 96573, 25065, '<td valign="top">Heh. If those boxers got that kind fo result, I''m ordering a case today! Great pic, would have liked to see more of her feet, though, since his were covered.</td>', 'Heh. If those boxers got that kind fo result, I''m ordering a case today! Great pic, would have liked to see more of her feet, though, since his were covered.', '2004-08-09 12:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(850729, 96549, 11895, '<td valign="top">good idea for the challenge but the background color is too close to the color of the shoes to give good definition, I would have preferred a more neutral gray bg</td>', 'good idea for the challenge but the background color is too close to the color of the shoes to give good definition, I would have preferred a more neutral gray bg', '2004-08-09 12:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(850739, 96402, 18197, '<td valign="top">Gratuitous cat score, too.<br/> <br/>Seriously, I like the focus and colors. The eye kind of steals the show.</td>', 'Gratuitous cat score, too. Seriously, I like the focus and colors. The eye kind of steals the show.', '2004-08-09 12:58:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(850749, 96515, 11895, '<td valign="top">bit too much frame but other than that a fine shot</td>', 'bit too much frame but other than that a fine shot', '2004-08-09 13:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(850754, 95828, 19035, '<td valign="top">drop dead funny - 9 -</td>', 'drop dead funny - 9 -', '2004-08-09 13:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(850757, 96599, 19035, '<td valign="top">winner - for sure ''10''</td>', 'winner - for sure ''10''', '2004-08-09 13:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(850758, 96298, 19035, '<td valign="top">...duck season - wabbit season....smile</td>', '...duck season - wabbit season....smile', '2004-08-09 13:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(850759, 96599, 21606, '<td valign="top">This is a Great idea. I really like how you put the strings straight onto the feet. The ball is very scintillating, and the image is very colorful. Your title completes it; very cleaver.</td>', 'This is a Great idea. I really like how you put the strings straight onto the feet. The ball is very scintillating, and the image is very colorful. Your title completes it; very cleaver.', '2004-08-09 13:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(850761, 96579, 21606, '<td valign="top">Wow, those are beautifully painted feet. How long did that take to do? I really enjoy the contrast between the feet and rug. Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Wow, those are beautifully painted feet. How long did that take to do? I really enjoy the contrast between the feet and rug. Wonderful shot.', '2004-08-09 13:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(850762, 96582, 21606, '<td valign="top">I love it! This is fantastic. 10</td>', 'I love it! This is fantastic. 10', '2004-08-09 13:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(850765, 95800, 21606, '<td valign="top">Those look like some tired feet. I like the lighting, it makes the photo.</td>', 'Those look like some tired feet. I like the lighting, it makes the photo.', '2004-08-09 13:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(850767, 96523, 21606, '<td valign="top">Kitty paws! Nice. I wish the girl looked like she was enjoying her time with the sweet feet.</td>', 'Kitty paws! Nice. I wish the girl looked like she was enjoying her time with the sweet feet.', '2004-08-09 13:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(850768, 96459, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so cute!  I love it!</td>', 'This is so cute!  I love it!', '2004-08-09 13:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(850769, 96517, 21606, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrast and composition. The feet are just far enough from the center of the photo to make it nice.</td>', 'Wonderful contrast and composition. The feet are just far enough from the center of the photo to make it nice.', '2004-08-09 13:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(850771, 96597, 8759, '<td valign="top">Too much of sky. Nice and comfy feeling but does not tell me more.</td>', 'Too much of sky. Nice and comfy feeling but does not tell me more.', '2004-08-09 13:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(850773, 96579, 7322, '<td valign="top">This needs a simpler background which doesn''t compete with the painted designs. A sandy beach would have been appropriate. <br/> <br/><i>Edited post-voting</i> Hi there...I''m sorry my comment was kind of blunt and overly critical sounding. <br/> <br/>My feelings about this image were that her feet were gorgeous and the painting was beautifully done but the rather busy carpet tends to compete with the painted elements. My instinct was that you chose the carpet to enhance the Eastern theme of the mandala and I should have made it clear that I was aware you had made a specific choice. My opinion is that an outdoors, natural background (my instinct says sand or sand and water) would have emphasized the organic,free-spirited quality of the woman who belongs to these lovely feet.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-20 14:28:53.</i></td>', 'This needs a simpler background which doesn''t compete with the painted designs. A sandy beach would have been appropriate.  Edited post-voting Hi there...I''m sorry my comment was kind of blunt and overly critical sounding.  My feelings about this image were that her feet were gorgeous and the painting was beautifully done but the rather busy carpet tends to compete with the painted elements. My instinct was that you chose the carpet to enhance the Eastern theme of the mandala and I should have made it clear that I was aware you had made a specific choice. My opinion is that an outdoors, natural background (my instinct says sand or sand and water) would have emphasized the organic,free-spirited quality of the woman who belongs to these lovely feet.', '2004-08-09 13:15:10.000000', '2004-08-20 15:28:53.000000', 1),
(850775, 96603, 7322, '<td valign="top">The pink stuff in the background is distracting. I kind of like the yellow.</td>', 'The pink stuff in the background is distracting. I kind of like the yellow.', '2004-08-09 13:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(850777, 96314, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition with wonderful effects of noise reduction software to give the feet a lifeless appearance. Lighting/shadows are very effective as well.  Great job!</td>', 'Excellent composition with wonderful effects of noise reduction software to give the feet a lifeless appearance. Lighting/shadows are very effective as well.  Great job!', '2004-08-09 13:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(850782, 96584, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''d like the composition much better without the oar showing. This is kind of stretching the challenge, IMO. What came to my mind was, if this was a challenge called ''head'' would a photo of a hat work?<br/>I''d have to say no. Nice try though.</td>', 'I''d like the composition much better without the oar showing. This is kind of stretching the challenge, IMO. What came to my mind was, if this was a challenge called ''head'' would a photo of a hat work?I''d have to say no. Nice try though.', '2004-08-09 13:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(850784, 96402, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is disturbing. The cat''s eye has a glazed appearance. That combined with it''s posture makes it appear dead.</td>', 'This is disturbing. The cat''s eye has a glazed appearance. That combined with it''s posture makes it appear dead.', '2004-08-09 13:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(850792, 96505, 7322, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Creative and dynamic approach to a difficult subject.</td>', 'Excellent! Creative and dynamic approach to a difficult subject.', '2004-08-09 13:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(850793, 96556, 18958, '<td valign="top">I found your picture heida, nice work ! a10</td>', 'I found your picture heida, nice work ! a10', '2004-08-09 13:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(850796, 95448, 8759, '<td valign="top">Good colour and motion efect</td>', 'Good colour and motion efect', '2004-08-09 13:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(850797, 96608, 7322, '<td valign="top">While there are feet in this shot, they really don''t play a creative role. The main subject is obviously the boy on the swing and not his feet. Challenge aside, the shot is okay in terms of exposure and sharpness but the capture isn''t very compelling. We can''t really see his expression as his face is obscured by his hand and the chain. As an action shot it is very static. I don''t get the feeling of joy and exhilaration of being on a swing.</td>', 'While there are feet in this shot, they really don''t play a creative role. The main subject is obviously the boy on the swing and not his feet. Challenge aside, the shot is okay in terms of exposure and sharpness but the capture isn''t very compelling. We can''t really see his expression as his face is obscured by his hand and the chain. As an action shot it is very static. I don''t get the feeling of joy and exhilaration of being on a swing.', '2004-08-09 13:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(850798, 96266, 5822, '<td valign="top">Focus on the feet could be sharper and though I like the constrast in this image I think you''ve lost too much detail in the black of the shoes.  I also find the angle of view very common and not all that compelling.</td>', 'Focus on the feet could be sharper and though I like the constrast in this image I think you''ve lost too much detail in the black of the shoes.  I also find the angle of view very common and not all that compelling.', '2004-08-09 13:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(850803, 96609, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very odd composition and leads me to wonder what was going through the photographer''s mind when he/she thought up this idea. There seems to be very little connection between the title and the image. What do feet have to do with the cross and Ireland? The cropping is awkward at the top left side of the frame and the ankle bracelet is distracting. I like the green background and the sun flare in the corner.</td>', 'This is a very odd composition and leads me to wonder what was going through the photographer''s mind when he/she thought up this idea. There seems to be very little connection between the title and the image. What do feet have to do with the cross and Ireland? The cropping is awkward at the top left side of the frame and the ankle bracelet is distracting. I like the green background and the sun flare in the corner.', '2004-08-09 13:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(850806, 95803, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the soft feel of this photograph but feel you could have done better with some fill lighting to eliminate the shadow on the right foot. Also, a little more saturation to help bring out more of the blue of the toe ring would help.</td>', 'I like the soft feel of this photograph but feel you could have done better with some fill lighting to eliminate the shadow on the right foot. Also, a little more saturation to help bring out more of the blue of the toe ring would help.', '2004-08-09 13:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(850809, 96475, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think, perhaps, if the faces were cropped out the feet would play a more central role, creatively. However, as it is, they really aren''t the focal point of this shot. I like the high-key, contrasty approach.</td>', 'I think, perhaps, if the faces were cropped out the feet would play a more central role, creatively. However, as it is, they really aren''t the focal point of this shot. I like the high-key, contrasty approach.', '2004-08-09 13:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(850811, 96317, 14476, '<td valign="top">Cute pun.  Good one!</td>', 'Cute pun.  Good one!', '2004-08-09 13:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(850814, 96246, 8759, '<td valign="top">Good execution and DOF. Still there is nothing to tell about this picture. Is not an invitation... Is just a pic of her feet. 6 for the good execution</td>', 'Good execution and DOF. Still there is nothing to tell about this picture. Is not an invitation... Is just a pic of her feet. 6 for the good execution', '2004-08-09 13:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(850816, 96518, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title. "Oents?"  I think waiting until the elastic impressions from his sock faded might have been a good idea. The focus looks a bit off.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title. "Oents?"  I think waiting until the elastic impressions from his sock faded might have been a good idea. The focus looks a bit off.', '2004-08-09 13:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(850824, 96504, 7322, '<td valign="top">Might be better if the sky and most of the legs were cropped so that only the sand and feet showed. The legs are rather pasty and chunky looking and draw attention from the main interest which is the sand and the pattern created by the shadow of the subject.</td>', 'Might be better if the sky and most of the legs were cropped so that only the sand and feet showed. The legs are rather pasty and chunky looking and draw attention from the main interest which is the sand and the pattern created by the shadow of the subject.', '2004-08-09 13:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(850826, 96512, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is really stretching the notion of the challenge. One could argue that bees have feet but feet aren''t the creative element of this composition so one would be arguing in vain.</td>', 'This is really stretching the notion of the challenge. One could argue that bees have feet but feet aren''t the creative element of this composition so one would be arguing in vain.', '2004-08-09 13:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(850829, 96211, 8759, '<td valign="top">Exellent use of the background. Great DOF 7</td>', 'Exellent use of the background. Great DOF 7', '2004-08-09 13:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(850832, 95588, 7322, '<td valign="top">Feet really aren''t the focus of this shot and I think you know that.</td>', 'Feet really aren''t the focus of this shot and I think you know that.', '2004-08-09 13:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(850836, 96527, 7322, '<td valign="top">The lighting is ugly and harsh and the skin tones have reddish cast.</td>', 'The lighting is ugly and harsh and the skin tones have reddish cast.', '2004-08-09 13:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(850839, 95828, 3569, '<td valign="top">Look to healthy too me, but that''s good.</td>', 'Look to healthy too me, but that''s good.', '2004-08-09 13:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(850840, 96566, 10686, '<td valign="top">Neat concept, I wish it were executed better. I''m sure you are aware that the bottom right corner is blown out, as are the socks, which is just too bad because this shot could be great.</td>', 'Neat concept, I wish it were executed better. I''m sure you are aware that the bottom right corner is blown out, as are the socks, which is just too bad because this shot could be great.', '2004-08-09 13:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(850842, 96556, 10686, '<td valign="top">Strange, but in a good way</td>', 'Strange, but in a good way', '2004-08-09 13:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(850844, 96430, 3569, '<td valign="top">The joy of sox...</td>', 'The joy of sox...', '2004-08-09 13:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(850848, 96549, 8759, '<td valign="top">The man shouts: WOOOWWWW. Took me some time to look at the feet and not elsewhere. Good lighting and clear picture. Good composition. Maybe if it was cropped to see more of the legs would do better. 7</td>', 'The man shouts: WOOOWWWW. Took me some time to look at the feet and not elsewhere. Good lighting and clear picture. Good composition. Maybe if it was cropped to see more of the legs would do better. 7', '2004-08-09 13:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(850850, 95895, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like this picture a lot!   It''s very striking.</td>', 'I like this picture a lot!   It''s very striking.', '2004-08-09 13:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(850853, 96580, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a really great picture!  I love it!</td>', 'This is a really great picture!  I love it!', '2004-08-09 14:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(850859, 96582, 25143, '<td valign="top">would have preferred either a little less symmetry or more evenness - still, amusing mood and contrast</td>', 'would have preferred either a little less symmetry or more evenness - still, amusing mood and contrast', '2004-08-09 14:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(850862, 96580, 8759, '<td valign="top">Winner! Great composition and action caption. Good details and nice balance of blue against the black background. 9<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-17 14:39:37.</i></td>', 'Winner! Great composition and action caption. Good details and nice balance of blue against the black background. 9', '2004-08-09 14:07:15.000000', '2004-08-17 15:39:37.000000', 1),
(850864, 96507, 25143, '<td valign="top">great grey/yellow and well-lit</td>', 'great grey/yellow and well-lit', '2004-08-09 14:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(850866, 96453, 16106, '<td valign="top">The subject here is only barely tangentially within the subject of the challenge, therefore it is not the best of the group in that one reguard. As a shot in a gallerey it is amazing and near perfect. I feel bad giving it an 8 both because it should be lower because the challenge is skirted, and it should be higher because this is great work.</td>', 'The subject here is only barely tangentially within the subject of the challenge, therefore it is not the best of the group in that one reguard. As a shot in a gallerey it is amazing and near perfect. I feel bad giving it an 8 both because it should be lower because the challenge is skirted, and it should be higher because this is great work.', '2004-08-09 14:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(850868, 96562, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great picture!  I don''t see how it could be improved -- 10!</td>', 'Great picture!  I don''t see how it could be improved -- 10!', '2004-08-09 14:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(850869, 96585, 25143, '<td valign="top">not enough shadow from the feet</td>', 'not enough shadow from the feet', '2004-08-09 14:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(850870, 95630, 25143, '<td valign="top">too much clichee</td>', 'too much clichee', '2004-08-09 14:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(850872, 96211, 16106, '<td valign="top">I hate work like this, when someone does the same sort of shot you do for a challenge only they do it better.  Perhaps a bit shallow on the DOF but a lovely shot.</td>', 'I hate work like this, when someone does the same sort of shot you do for a challenge only they do it better.  Perhaps a bit shallow on the DOF but a lovely shot.', '2004-08-09 14:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(850873, 95895, 25143, '<td valign="top">strange contrast between stillness of feet and implied movement from impact</td>', 'strange contrast between stillness of feet and implied movement from impact', '2004-08-09 14:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(850879, 96402, 25143, '<td valign="top">too much background information - great cat profile and claw</td>', 'too much background information - great cat profile and claw', '2004-08-09 14:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(850880, 95589, 25143, '<td valign="top">cool idea</td>', 'cool idea', '2004-08-09 14:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(850881, 96064, 25143, '<td valign="top">too messy composition despite the nice idea - I prefer the nose/ears detail</td>', 'too messy composition despite the nice idea - I prefer the nose/ears detail', '2004-08-09 14:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(850882, 96566, 25143, '<td valign="top">positioning the feet at an angle to the stone grid would have implied more movement</td>', 'positioning the feet at an angle to the stone grid would have implied more movement', '2004-08-09 14:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
