(851060, 96556, 21606, '<td valign="top">This photo is breathtaking. It almost looks like something Heida would take. The clouds obviously are wonderful, and the way you played the feet into the image is outstanding. Great Job, and nice lighting.</td>', 'This photo is breathtaking. It almost looks like something Heida would take. The clouds obviously are wonderful, and the way you played the feet into the image is outstanding. Great Job, and nice lighting.', '2004-08-09 16:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
