(851064, 96603, 21606, '<td valign="top">Those feet are upclose and personal. I like the lighting, both how it all comes from one light source giving it that 1:8 lighting look, and how you added that nice yellowish-orange tint to the photo that compliments the peach color of the feet.</td>', 'Those feet are upclose and personal. I like the lighting, both how it all comes from one light source giving it that 1:8 lighting look, and how you added that nice yellowish-orange tint to the photo that compliments the peach color of the feet.', '2004-08-09 16:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(851068, 96469, 21606, '<td valign="top">I''m sure a LOT of people are going to knock you for entering this photo, but I LOVE your creative cranium. It is a good shot, and an out of the box idea - 10</td>', 'I''m sure a LOT of people are going to knock you for entering this photo, but I LOVE your creative cranium. It is a good shot, and an out of the box idea - 10', '2004-08-09 16:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
