(851126, 96579, 3087, '<td valign="top">With such an intricate pattern painted on the feet a completely plain floor surface would be much much better. Ignoring that carpet pattern, the composition (position of feet within frame etc) works well.</td>', 'With such an intricate pattern painted on the feet a completely plain floor surface would be much much better. Ignoring that carpet pattern, the composition (position of feet within frame etc) works well.', '2004-08-09 17:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
