(851172, 96486, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not sure why I like this so much - I think it''s because of the unusual composition and the way that an important element of the "story" - the screen hiding the people whose feet we are seeing - is actually providing a block of solid black to balance the shadow in the lower right corner. Composition is just so excellent. 10</td>', 'Not sure why I like this so much - I think it''s because of the unusual composition and the way that an important element of the "story" - the screen hiding the people whose feet we are seeing - is actually providing a block of solid black to balance the shadow in the lower right corner. Composition is just so excellent. 10', '2004-08-09 17:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
