(851213, 96583, 12857, '<td valign="top">I dont know how many people will get this photo.  It really shows our connection with our pets.  It is so tender and loving.   Bravo.   The soft focus is perfect!!  Great job.  With photos like this I may never get a ribbon.<br/>dc</td>', 'I dont know how many people will get this photo.  It really shows our connection with our pets.  It is so tender and loving.   Bravo.   The soft focus is perfect!!  Great job.  With photos like this I may never get a ribbon.dc', '2004-08-09 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(851216, 96397, 22922, '<td valign="top">Get rid of the title, and this is a fabulous image.  There is mystery and emotion, sharp,sleek lines, nice DOF and lighting.</td>', 'Get rid of the title, and this is a fabulous image.  There is mystery and emotion, sharp,sleek lines, nice DOF and lighting.', '2004-08-09 18:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(851218, 96064, 12857, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Are you a photojournalist!!   No fair!!<br/>dc</td>', 'Great photo.  Are you a photojournalist!!   No fair!!dc', '2004-08-09 18:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(851220, 96452, 12857, '<td valign="top">This photo is almost perfect for me.  I think I would like to have seen the entire foot.  <br/>dc</td>', 'This photo is almost perfect for me.  I think I would like to have seen the entire foot.  dc', '2004-08-09 18:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(851221, 96338, 12857, '<td valign="top">Sick sick sick but an outstanding photo.  Best score I have given so far. <br/>Only complaint would be that I would have straightened out the photo. <br/>Great job. <br/>dc</td>', 'Sick sick sick but an outstanding photo.  Best score I have given so far. Only complaint would be that I would have straightened out the photo. Great job. dc', '2004-08-09 18:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(851222, 96314, 22922, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, love the lighting and DOF, sharp lines on that tag! Looks like too much NeatImage on the feet, or maybe those are rubber feet?  The tag looks sharp, so maybe you used rubber feet.  Would like the camera to be a bit lower.</td>', 'Excellent idea, love the lighting and DOF, sharp lines on that tag! Looks like too much NeatImage on the feet, or maybe those are rubber feet?  The tag looks sharp, so maybe you used rubber feet.  Would like the camera to be a bit lower.', '2004-08-09 18:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(851224, 96549, 12857, '<td valign="top">This is so sexy!!!  And  I dont even like women.  That says something for your talent!!!!<br/>dc</td>', 'This is so sexy!!!  And  I dont even like women.  That says something for your talent!!!!dc', '2004-08-09 18:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(851228, 96233, 12857, '<td valign="top">Damn people like you.  At this rate I may never get a ribbon.  This is such a sensual, beautiful photo.  Great Great  job!!!<br/>dc</td>', 'Damn people like you.  At this rate I may never get a ribbon.  This is such a sensual, beautiful photo.  Great Great  job!!!dc', '2004-08-09 18:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(851231, 96596, 12857, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I thought about this exact same photo but could not have executed it as well.   My idea was for a woman painting a mans toe nails.  Great job. <br/>dc</td>', 'Great shot.  I thought about this exact same photo but could not have executed it as well.   My idea was for a woman painting a mans toe nails.  Great job. dc', '2004-08-09 18:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
