(851240, 96505, 12857, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this photo the more I realize it kicked the pants off my photo.  This is great.  I would love to know how you did it.   Great job .</td>', 'The more I look at this photo the more I realize it kicked the pants off my photo.  This is great.  I would love to know how you did it.   Great job .', '2004-08-09 18:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
