(851284, 96116, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like the simplicity and lack of distracting elements.  i also like the angle the leg comes from.  the one thing i am unsure of is the ring.  in some ways it seems out of place since there is nothing but skin in the rest of the picture.  overall a really nice pic.</td>', 'i really like the simplicity and lack of distracting elements.  i also like the angle the leg comes from.  the one thing i am unsure of is the ring.  in some ways it seems out of place since there is nothing but skin in the rest of the picture.  overall a really nice pic.', '2004-08-09 18:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
