(851984, 96604, 21072, '<td valign="top">I like this photo ... but I dont think the light at the top adds anything to the picture.</td>', 'I like this photo ... but I dont think the light at the top adds anything to the picture.', '2004-08-10 02:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
