(852005, 96581, 21072, '<td valign="top">This photo is great.  So far it is my fav.  Love the colours and editing you did.</td>', 'This photo is great.  So far it is my fav.  Love the colours and editing you did.', '2004-08-10 02:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
