(852377, 96469, 23394, '<td valign="top">thanks for a different take on ''feet''.  as to this image, nice action shot that could be dress up a little with something like photoshop.  i read somewhere that there isn''t a single picture that can''t be improved someway in post-processing.  while i prefer doing as much as possible in camera, there is a lot to be said for mastering post-processing.  even on a hazy afternoon, you can still make the colors pop, which, imho, is what would make this image better.</td>', 'thanks for a different take on ''feet''.  as to this image, nice action shot that could be dress up a little with something like photoshop.  i read somewhere that there isn''t a single picture that can''t be improved someway in post-processing.  while i prefer doing as much as possible in camera, there is a lot to be said for mastering post-processing.  even on a hazy afternoon, you can still make the colors pop, which, imho, is what would make this image better.', '2004-08-10 11:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
