(852465, 96465, 24240, '<td valign="top">Crop vertically, right iside,  just left of the patella, and I think you will have a work of art.  Yes the blues in the water match the denim very nicely, but proportionately there is eough of it already without the big patch of blue jean. Otherwise, beautiful colors! Cropping would also direct the eye to the focus which is feet.  Re: title...simply "After a Long Hike" would be enough, as the picture tells the rest and very well!</td>', 'Crop vertically, right iside,  just left of the patella, and I think you will have a work of art.  Yes the blues in the water match the denim very nicely, but proportionately there is eough of it already without the big patch of blue jean. Otherwise, beautiful colors! Cropping would also direct the eye to the focus which is feet.  Re: title...simply "After a Long Hike" would be enough, as the picture tells the rest and very well!', '2004-08-10 12:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(852466, 96197, 23394, '<td valign="top">love the expression.  this might look better as a complete bw.  you might also want to try this shooting on an angle that offers a little more head room.</td>', 'love the expression.  this might look better as a complete bw.  you might also want to try this shooting on an angle that offers a little more head room.', '2004-08-10 12:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
