(852472, 95688, 23394, '<td valign="top">aw, com''on...you tellin me you couldn''t sit down with your knees together?  you had a whole 10 seconds.  this image could use a little less flash and more leg ;)</td>', 'aw, com''on...you tellin me you couldn''t sit down with your knees together?  you had a whole 10 seconds.  this image could use a little less flash and more leg ;)', '2004-08-10 12:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(852476, 96501, 24240, '<td valign="top">Not a pretty picture exactly, but a defiite reality shot.  It does have some nice features though in that you see the rule of thirds used through out and there is nice contrast between what I think are masculine feet and the fluffy bubbles.  The drain/overflow gives it a nice little punch and it well placed.  I thought the feet look NOT relaxed at first then I noticed the water flowing down and now see them as arching to enjoy he sensation. "Personalized" looking angle or set up.</td>', 'Not a pretty picture exactly, but a defiite reality shot.  It does have some nice features though in that you see the rule of thirds used through out and there is nice contrast between what I think are masculine feet and the fluffy bubbles.  The drain/overflow gives it a nice little punch and it well placed.  I thought the feet look NOT relaxed at first then I noticed the water flowing down and now see them as arching to enjoy he sensation. "Personalized" looking angle or set up.', '2004-08-10 12:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(852482, 95591, 24240, '<td valign="top">Almost a yin,yang.  Increasing the bright / dark contrast a little would inhance the design aspect, I think, as would muting the sharpness of the detail. NIce picture!</td>', 'Almost a yin,yang.  Increasing the bright / dark contrast a little would inhance the design aspect, I think, as would muting the sharpness of the detail. NIce picture!', '2004-08-10 12:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(852489, 96488, 20150, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, but wish that the duck in the middle and the duck on the right did not have there heads cropped off.  I think I would have scored this higher if I could have seen there heads.  This was a hard competition and I could not come up with an idea so I am definitely not trying to put this photo down.</td>', 'I really like this picture, but wish that the duck in the middle and the duck on the right did not have there heads cropped off.  I think I would have scored this higher if I could have seen there heads.  This was a hard competition and I could not come up with an idea so I am definitely not trying to put this photo down.', '2004-08-10 13:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(852490, 96065, 24240, '<td valign="top">This, though contrived, comes across as a pyscho-social commentary.  It makes me sad and concerned.  Both subjects, perhaps the same, deserve better than they are getting.  As as a composition it certainly communicates.  Design-wise, the two objects could be placed slightly closer together...the foot drawn back slightly to a 1/3 position so as not to ovrwhelm with  buckles and staps, and to enhance balance and contrast.</td>', 'This, though contrived, comes across as a pyscho-social commentary.  It makes me sad and concerned.  Both subjects, perhaps the same, deserve better than they are getting.  As as a composition it certainly communicates.  Design-wise, the two objects could be placed slightly closer together...the foot drawn back slightly to a 1/3 position so as not to ovrwhelm with  buckles and staps, and to enhance balance and contrast.', '2004-08-10 13:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(852491, 96585, 20150, '<td valign="top">Love the way the shadows play in this picture. Good Job.</td>', 'Love the way the shadows play in this picture. Good Job.', '2004-08-10 13:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(852499, 96314, 13365, '<td valign="top">My favorite out of the bunch, I hope it ribbons! Hopefully people wont mark you down because of the subject matter (9)</td>', 'My favorite out of the bunch, I hope it ribbons! Hopefully people wont mark you down because of the subject matter (9)', '2004-08-10 13:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(852512, 95828, 15597, '<td valign="top">Excellent one. <br/>Good composition and lightning. Also so clever idea. Congrats.</td>', 'Excellent one. Good composition and lightning. Also so clever idea. Congrats.', '2004-08-10 13:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(852552, 96562, 20150, '<td valign="top">Love this picture, can not think of anything to critique on this one.  Great catch.</td>', 'Love this picture, can not think of anything to critique on this one.  Great catch.', '2004-08-10 13:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(852575, 96597, 20150, '<td valign="top">I was trying to use the beach in some way with an entry, but never came up with a good idea.  You came up with one that I couldn''t.</td>', 'I was trying to use the beach in some way with an entry, but never came up with a good idea.  You came up with one that I couldn''t.', '2004-08-10 14:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(852604, 95605, 21379, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite so far! It''s the most playful -- instead of just showing feet in an environment, you''re using feet to tell a story! A very short story, yes, but a delightful and sweet story all the same!</td>', 'This is my favorite so far! It''s the most playful -- instead of just showing feet in an environment, you''re using feet to tell a story! A very short story, yes, but a delightful and sweet story all the same!', '2004-08-10 14:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(852673, 96580, 3697, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast between the blue and the black, and the shine the water gives to the foot is outstanding. This is some nice work.</td>', 'I really like the contrast between the blue and the black, and the shine the water gives to the foot is outstanding. This is some nice work.', '2004-08-10 14:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(852771, 96505, 20150, '<td valign="top">Love the movement of the pavemant in this picture.  The old tennis shoe adds to the skate board feel.</td>', 'Love the movement of the pavemant in this picture.  The old tennis shoe adds to the skate board feel.', '2004-08-10 16:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(852772, 96522, 20150, '<td valign="top">The shoes seem to be a little too much out of focus, I would like focus on the shoes to be a little more.  But I like the idea of her resting here feet behind the shoes.</td>', 'The shoes seem to be a little too much out of focus, I would like focus on the shoes to be a little more.  But I like the idea of her resting here feet behind the shoes.', '2004-08-10 16:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(852775, 96477, 20150, '<td valign="top">This would have worked better if her face was fully blocked or I was able to see her whol face.  That is my only critique on this photo.</td>', 'This would have worked better if her face was fully blocked or I was able to see her whol face.  That is my only critique on this photo.', '2004-08-10 16:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(852778, 96333, 20150, '<td valign="top">Love the focus of this picture, nice and crisp.  Black and white was also a good choice for this photo.</td>', 'Love the focus of this picture, nice and crisp.  Black and white was also a good choice for this photo.', '2004-08-10 16:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(852781, 96599, 20150, '<td valign="top">I liked this photo when I thought it was shoe on the thumbnail, but my thoughts went up on it when i saw that the shoe was painted on.</td>', 'I liked this photo when I thought it was shoe on the thumbnail, but my thoughts went up on it when i saw that the shoe was painted on.', '2004-08-10 17:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(852812, 95591, 7711, '<td valign="top">you will probably laugh when I say this, but I think a tigher crop would have helped -- take off the left leg/ankle to really bring the attention to the shape of the feet. I also think I would have liked to see a bit more toe (voyeur in me I''m sure) I like that this is in BW, and the tones are good. Ideally, I would have preferred a little more contrast or something to make it more dramatic.</td>', 'you will probably laugh when I say this, but I think a tigher crop would have helped -- take off the left leg/ankle to really bring the attention to the shape of the feet. I also think I would have liked to see a bit more toe (voyeur in me I''m sure) I like that this is in BW, and the tones are good. Ideally, I would have preferred a little more contrast or something to make it more dramatic.', '2004-08-10 17:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(852814, 95591, 4493, '<td valign="top">There is nothing that grabs me in the shot. Looks like a quick snap while sitting on your bed. The lines are ok, but again, just kinda luke warm about it.</td>', 'There is nothing that grabs me in the shot. Looks like a quick snap while sitting on your bed. The lines are ok, but again, just kinda luke warm about it.', '2004-08-10 17:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(852815, 96602, 7711, '<td valign="top">great concept..we bit dark/underexposed though.</td>', 'great concept..we bit dark/underexposed though.', '2004-08-10 17:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(852821, 96557, 7711, '<td valign="top">please forgive the brevity/abruptness of this comment, but I find the lighting to be harsh and the crop doesn''t really give us a story as to how these shoes got this way or why its interesting/important that they are.</td>', 'please forgive the brevity/abruptness of this comment, but I find the lighting to be harsh and the crop doesn''t really give us a story as to how these shoes got this way or why its interesting/important that they are.', '2004-08-10 17:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(852823, 96292, 7711, '<td valign="top">wonderful lighting. I love the black and white as well. the blacks are so dark without too much detail loss.</td>', 'wonderful lighting. I love the black and white as well. the blacks are so dark without too much detail loss.', '2004-08-10 17:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(852844, 96573, 7711, '<td valign="top">cute concept, but I think the shot itself is a bit dark/underexposed and the crop isn''t doing much for me...i guess what I am missing is a bit of a story about this. It just seems right now like two people with underwear around their ankles..not two lovers, which I think is a much better story!</td>', 'cute concept, but I think the shot itself is a bit dark/underexposed and the crop isn''t doing much for me...i guess what I am missing is a bit of a story about this. It just seems right now like two people with underwear around their ankles..not two lovers, which I think is a much better story!', '2004-08-10 17:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(852851, 95630, 3087, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like selective desaturation because so many of the examples seem to use it for the sake of using it rather than because it''s use really adds something to the shot that wouldn''t be achieved with all colour or all black and white. In your shot I really like it''s use because, to me, the colour really highlights the message that skin colour isn''t important and that people of different races often have more in common than they have not in common. Nicely composed too, simple and unusual. Texture and pattern of floor surface complements rather than distracts. 8</td>', 'I don''t usually like selective desaturation because so many of the examples seem to use it for the sake of using it rather than because it''s use really adds something to the shot that wouldn''t be achieved with all colour or all black and white. In your shot I really like it''s use because, to me, the colour really highlights the message that skin colour isn''t important and that people of different races often have more in common than they have not in common. Nicely composed too, simple and unusual. Texture and pattern of floor surface complements rather than distracts. 8', '2004-08-10 17:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(852857, 95591, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a challenging composition.  I definitely understand the theme and your intent with this photo, but something is causing me to struggle with it.  It may possibly be the exclusion of the toes on the right foot.  Something just doesn''t ''flow'' and I can''t really put my finger on exactly what it is.  It may simply be that the S is not strong enough to successfully create the flow.  Another possible modification to increase the strength of the curves here would have been to let them create a little stronger diagonal in the frame by rotating the camera slightly counter clockwise for the photo.  I can''t really ''recreate'' this image a different way in my mind without actually trying it :)  <br/></td>', 'This is a challenging composition.  I definitely understand the theme and your intent with this photo, but something is causing me to struggle with it.  It may possibly be the exclusion of the toes on the right foot.  Something just doesn''t ''flow'' and I can''t really put my finger on exactly what it is.  It may simply be that the S is not strong enough to successfully create the flow.  Another possible modification to increase the strength of the curves here would have been to let them create a little stronger diagonal in the frame by rotating the camera slightly counter clockwise for the photo.  I can''t really ''recreate'' this image a different way in my mind without actually trying it :)  ', '2004-08-10 17:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(852861, 96567, 7711, '<td valign="top">great depth of field (no pun intended) Not keep on the cropped out foot though. Otherwise brilliant!</td>', 'great depth of field (no pun intended) Not keep on the cropped out foot though. Otherwise brilliant!', '2004-08-10 17:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(852863, 96549, 15645, '<td valign="top">Quite nice :)</td>', 'Quite nice :)', '2004-08-10 17:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(852865, 96465, 15645, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. The feet look posessed with all the colours in them.</td>', 'I really like this one. The feet look posessed with all the colours in them.', '2004-08-10 17:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(852866, 96314, 7711, '<td valign="top">for such a "raw" sort of image (a dead body with a toe tag) i think its too "smooth" looking. A little more grittiness (by way of grain or noise maybe?) would have worked well for the overall message.</td>', 'for such a "raw" sort of image (a dead body with a toe tag) i think its too "smooth" looking. A little more grittiness (by way of grain or noise maybe?) would have worked well for the overall message.', '2004-08-10 17:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(852868, 96197, 12374, '<td valign="top">Quite a feat! Taking a photo in that position, that is.  I remember doing this, butno t the photo.  Great shot.</td>', 'Quite a feat! Taking a photo in that position, that is.  I remember doing this, butno t the photo.  Great shot.', '2004-08-10 18:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(852872, 96556, 12374, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about the ''fallng'', but as a life drawing practitioner, the feet fascinate me.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'I don''t know about the ''fallng'', but as a life drawing practitioner, the feet fascinate me.  Interesting shot.', '2004-08-10 18:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(852874, 96266, 7711, '<td valign="top">compositionally its pretty good, but the focus is not spot on anywhere...except maybe the very tip of the left shoe.</td>', 'compositionally its pretty good, but the focus is not spot on anywhere...except maybe the very tip of the left shoe.', '2004-08-10 18:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(852877, 95591, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the way it flows, however I feel the lighting a bit too harsh.    The feet look too shiny.  I bet the owner of the feet is a cutie though :)</td>', 'I like the way it flows, however I feel the lighting a bit too harsh.    The feet look too shiny.  I bet the owner of the feet is a cutie though :)', '2004-08-10 18:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(852878, 96582, 12374, '<td valign="top">Fun, and daring, from a photographic viewpoint.</td>', 'Fun, and daring, from a photographic viewpoint.', '2004-08-10 18:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(852882, 96505, 12374, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I guess there is a foot in there,</td>', 'Good shot.  I guess there is a foot in there,', '2004-08-10 18:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(852884, 96596, 12374, '<td valign="top">Inventive shot.  Too bad the brush does not show up a bit better.  Well, guessing is fun too.</td>', 'Inventive shot.  Too bad the brush does not show up a bit better.  Well, guessing is fun too.', '2004-08-10 18:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(852886, 96593, 12374, '<td valign="top">Going for the not so obvious. Food interpretation.</td>', 'Going for the not so obvious. Food interpretation.', '2004-08-10 18:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(852888, 96317, 12374, '<td valign="top">Good title. Nice feet, Peaceful image.</td>', 'Good title. Nice feet, Peaceful image.', '2004-08-10 18:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(852898, 96507, 12374, '<td valign="top">With this title, I amstill wondering.  Amazing shot.  Good composition.</td>', 'With this title, I amstill wondering.  Amazing shot.  Good composition.', '2004-08-10 18:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(852903, 96602, 12374, '<td valign="top">Canadian eh?</td>', 'Canadian eh?', '2004-08-10 18:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(852914, 96504, 12374, '<td valign="top">Colville-like image.</td>', 'Colville-like image.', '2004-08-10 18:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(852916, 96581, 12374, '<td valign="top">Like Norman Rockwell.  Good observation.  Good composition.  Good shot</td>', 'Like Norman Rockwell.  Good observation.  Good composition.  Good shot', '2004-08-10 18:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(852919, 96603, 7711, '<td valign="top">almost a sunflower sort of composition. cute.</td>', 'almost a sunflower sort of composition. cute.', '2004-08-10 18:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(852937, 95448, 23394, '<td valign="top">you nailed it with this one!  i don''t know how many you had to shoot, but this one takes the cake.  way to go!</td>', 'you nailed it with this one!  i don''t know how many you had to shoot, but this one takes the cake.  way to go!', '2004-08-10 18:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(852952, 96063, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image. One would never expect to see an image of feet being used so successfully to convey poverty. The black and white treatment focuses our attention on the textures of the worn and dirty socks and shoes. The jeans don''t appear to be correspondingly dirty and worn though, which is a little strange. 8</td>', 'A beautiful image. One would never expect to see an image of feet being used so successfully to convey poverty. The black and white treatment focuses our attention on the textures of the worn and dirty socks and shoes. The jeans don''t appear to be correspondingly dirty and worn though, which is a little strange. 8', '2004-08-10 19:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(852955, 96534, 19040, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but a little too dark.</td>', 'Nice shot, but a little too dark.', '2004-08-10 19:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(852956, 96580, 19040, '<td valign="top">I love the color of the water and the texture of the foot.</td>', 'I love the color of the water and the texture of the foot.', '2004-08-10 19:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(852959, 96510, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and I think the desat works well also</td>', 'Nice composition and I think the desat works well also', '2004-08-10 19:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(852960, 96566, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good composition and good use of natural light give this image added impact</td>', 'Good composition and good use of natural light give this image added impact', '2004-08-10 19:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(852973, 95368, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the air of mystery that the darkness invokes in this image.The light silhouetting the figure and the motion blur in the foot all add impact.<br/>Nice work...good luck<br/></td>', 'I like the air of mystery that the darkness invokes in this image.The light silhouetting the figure and the motion blur in the foot all add impact.Nice work...good luck', '2004-08-10 19:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(852979, 96457, 14614, '<td valign="top">Extra points for a creative presentation.. fun shot to study</td>', 'Extra points for a creative presentation.. fun shot to study', '2004-08-10 19:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(852982, 96486, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this time -- I really like the compostion and B&amp;W treatment.</td>', 'One of my favorites this time -- I really like the compostion and B&W treatment.', '2004-08-10 19:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(852983, 96566, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of my ribbon picks this challenge - good use of color, composition is just right, soft shadow and light work well.</td>', 'One of my ribbon picks this challenge - good use of color, composition is just right, soft shadow and light work well.', '2004-08-10 20:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(852985, 95828, 14614, '<td valign="top">good humor here - use of B&amp;W works well, composition is great... a ribbon pick</td>', 'good humor here - use of B&W works well, composition is great... a ribbon pick', '2004-08-10 20:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
