(853918, 96452, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice title, good idea. Ripples around the feet are interesting. I''d like to maybe see more of the feet, it just looks funny having them cut off at the toes.</td>', 'Nice title, good idea. Ripples around the feet are interesting. I''d like to maybe see more of the feet, it just looks funny having them cut off at the toes.', '2004-08-11 04:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(853919, 96593, 22748, '<td valign="top">Doh!! *groan* I just knew this was coming. <br/> <br/>It''s good though. I like the colors and the DOF. Nice.</td>', 'Doh!! *groan* I just knew this was coming.  It''s good though. I like the colors and the DOF. Nice.', '2004-08-11 04:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
