(853921, 96022, 22748, '<td valign="top">Oh, original idea. Nice. Very nice elegant border goes well with the nice looking shoes. The B&amp;W looks good.</td>', 'Oh, original idea. Nice. Very nice elegant border goes well with the nice looking shoes. The B&W looks good.', '2004-08-11 04:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(853926, 96457, 22748, '<td valign="top">Yes! This is brilliant. I love everything about this image. The selective desat has been used in a refreshing and original way, and in addition to using the desat and the border to bring the user''s attention to the focus of the image, the sharp focus only inside the box helps as well.<br/> <br/>Sorry I can''t be more helpful, but I can''t think of anything to critique about this image. Okay, so there''s a speck of dirt below the table leg the guy''s foot is on. ;-)  Yeah. Now I feel better. 10 10 10</td>', 'Yes! This is brilliant. I love everything about this image. The selective desat has been used in a refreshing and original way, and in addition to using the desat and the border to bring the user''s attention to the focus of the image, the sharp focus only inside the box helps as well. Sorry I can''t be more helpful, but I can''t think of anything to critique about this image. Okay, so there''s a speck of dirt below the table leg the guy''s foot is on. ;-)  Yeah. Now I feel better. 10 10 10', '2004-08-11 04:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(853927, 96601, 1031, '<td valign="top">It is election season after all. I like the black and white ... I wonder if you considered removing the eyebolt -- it''s the only thing not animal or vegetable in the picture and kind of "sticks out" because of that, and because it''s sticking out : )<br/> <br/>I Like the tone range and detail.</td>', 'It is election season after all. I like the black and white ... I wonder if you considered removing the eyebolt -- it''s the only thing not animal or vegetable in the picture and kind of "sticks out" because of that, and because it''s sticking out : ) I Like the tone range and detail.', '2004-08-11 04:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(853930, 96492, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, daring execution.</td>', 'Nice idea, daring execution.', '2004-08-11 04:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(853932, 96314, 22748, '<td valign="top">Genius! Pure genius. The execution is perfect. The plasticy feel of the feet is interesting and nifty. Intentionally over-NeatImaged? Or maybe the model just has really smooth feet. I love this shot. Jacko? 10</td>', 'Genius! Pure genius. The execution is perfect. The plasticy feel of the feet is interesting and nifty. Intentionally over-NeatImaged? Or maybe the model just has really smooth feet. I love this shot. Jacko? 10', '2004-08-11 04:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(853935, 96567, 1031, '<td valign="top">Seems like a tricky proposition to get so shallow a DOF at that distance -- Very nice job. Was this a night game under lights?</td>', 'Seems like a tricky proposition to get so shallow a DOF at that distance -- Very nice job. Was this a night game under lights?', '2004-08-11 04:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(853940, 96266, 22748, '<td valign="top">Oooh, nice feet. Cool toenail polish. I like the colors in this. Nice DOF keeps the background from getting distracting. The feet are a little blurry though, OOF? 7</td>', 'Oooh, nice feet. Cool toenail polish. I like the colors in this. Nice DOF keeps the background from getting distracting. The feet are a little blurry though, OOF? 7', '2004-08-11 04:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(853941, 95828, 1031, '<td valign="top">A little graveyard humor : ) <br/>I think though that morgues are usually more dimly-lit than this ... It might be more realistic with different lighting, but you''ve definitely captured the main subject well.</td>', 'A little graveyard humor : ) I think though that morgues are usually more dimly-lit than this ... It might be more realistic with different lighting, but you''ve definitely captured the main subject well.', '2004-08-11 04:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
