(853947, 96246, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition. I like how the feet are in focus and her face is a little blurred. It might be nice if the wall above were as white as the bottom part of the image, but that''s minor. 7</td>', 'Nice simple composition. I like how the feet are in focus and her face is a little blurred. It might be nice if the wall above were as white as the bottom part of the image, but that''s minor. 7', '2004-08-11 04:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
