(853949, 96545, 1031, '<td valign="top">High-contrast technique seems suitable for this challenge. This is a good example, where the subject has distinctive shapes which show up well in high-contrast, and where you might not really want to see all the details ...</td>', 'High-contrast technique seems suitable for this challenge. This is a good example, where the subject has distinctive shapes which show up well in high-contrast, and where you might not really want to see all the details ...', '2004-08-11 04:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
