(855510, 96328, 12733, '<td valign="top">Clever idea; I guess most of us have had this kind of seat at one time or another. Her legs are attractive enough to pull attention away from the feet.</td>', 'Clever idea; I guess most of us have had this kind of seat at one time or another. Her legs are attractive enough to pull attention away from the feet.', '2004-08-11 18:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
