(856463, 96580, 16106, '<td valign="top">The blue is a bit surreal, but the reast of the shot is just lovely, especially the shine across the top of the foot. great water motion. How big is your aquarium? 8</td>', 'The blue is a bit surreal, but the reast of the shot is just lovely, especially the shine across the top of the foot. great water motion. How big is your aquarium? 8', '2004-08-12 02:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
