(856508, 96596, 19708, '<td valign="top">Not sure what doesn''t make this shot jump for me.<br/>Maybe it''s too washed-out (High-Key?) or just maybe the polish needs to really stand out. A minor hue shift on the polish?<br/>May have been a good candidate for a selective desaturation in a nice B &amp; W shot.<br/>Better than average. ((6))<br/>:)<br/></td>', 'Not sure what doesn''t make this shot jump for me.Maybe it''s too washed-out (High-Key?) or just maybe the polish needs to really stand out. A minor hue shift on the polish?May have been a good candidate for a selective desaturation in a nice B & W shot.Better than average. ((6)):)', '2004-08-12 03:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
