(856604, 96515, 11897, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the best in the challenge, would like to see her more to one side, instead of dead center. still worth a ribbon, 9</td>', 'I think this is one of the best in the challenge, would like to see her more to one side, instead of dead center. still worth a ribbon, 9', '2004-08-12 05:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(856605, 95895, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good capture - nice comp. Colour is a bit drab, so i''d experiment with colour balance to see what you could do to draw people''s attention away from the absolute basic colour-from-camera look. Try using Channel Mixer in greyscale mode then adjusting the opacity to see how it affects it. It may look a bit more gritty and meaningful.</td>', 'Good capture - nice comp. Colour is a bit drab, so i''d experiment with colour balance to see what you could do to draw people''s attention away from the absolute basic colour-from-camera look. Try using Channel Mixer in greyscale mode then adjusting the opacity to see how it affects it. It may look a bit more gritty and meaningful.', '2004-08-12 05:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(856607, 95605, 11897, '<td valign="top">The one thing that spoils this slightly is, the dirty feet.<br/>great shot. 8</td>', 'The one thing that spoils this slightly is, the dirty feet.great shot. 8', '2004-08-12 05:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
