(857264, 96465, 19608, '<td valign="top">I can relate to this!  I do a lot of hiking in the Sierra - and look forward to this exact event.  Great idea, perfect shuttter speed for the water. Just a very well done image.</td>', 'I can relate to this!  I do a lot of hiking in the Sierra - and look forward to this exact event.  Great idea, perfect shuttter speed for the water. Just a very well done image.', '2004-08-12 14:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
