(857617, 96407, 14863, '<td valign="top">Hehe, this is very cute. I like the perspective, it''s different than t he  other photos. The blue of the urinal thingy is actually awesome ''cause it''s the  same color as the blue  in the floor. I also like the  dof, I  wish the top of t he  handle part was more in focus but it''s just fine. This is awesome- 8</td>', 'Hehe, this is very cute. I like the perspective, it''s different than t he  other photos. The blue of the urinal thingy is actually awesome ''cause it''s the  same color as the blue  in the floor. I also like the  dof, I  wish the top of t he  handle part was more in focus but it''s just fine. This is awesome- 8', '2004-08-12 18:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
