(858819, 96537, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier, returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Peace, tranquility, flowers, feet and sensuality. Very nice comp. The only thing I would have changed is the color valur so as not to have the blue shadows. Bumping from 5 to 6.</td>', 'Voted earlier, returning for comments. Peace, tranquility, flowers, feet and sensuality. Very nice comp. The only thing I would have changed is the color valur so as not to have the blue shadows. Bumping from 5 to 6.', '2004-08-13 16:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
