(858854, 96452, 24642, '<td valign="top">The title gives me the Barry Manillow syndrome. :-)  Nice shot.  The colour somehow indicates that the water is cold.  Maybe the picture would be stronger with feet occupying more of the frame?</td>', 'The title gives me the Barry Manillow syndrome. :-)  Nice shot.  The colour somehow indicates that the water is cold.  Maybe the picture would be stronger with feet occupying more of the frame?', '2004-08-13 17:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(858860, 96517, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting. Very clean.  Although my first impression was why socks?  Then I thought, hmm wouldn''t that be too much of a cliche to have bare feet?  I like the socks better.  The dark area in the upper left corner is a bit to strong for my taste.  Dit you try cropping it out?</td>', 'Very nice lighting. Very clean.  Although my first impression was why socks?  Then I thought, hmm wouldn''t that be too much of a cliche to have bare feet?  I like the socks better.  The dark area in the upper left corner is a bit to strong for my taste.  Dit you try cropping it out?', '2004-08-13 17:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(858863, 96064, 24642, '<td valign="top">Original shot, but I find to much distraction in the right half of the frame.</td>', 'Original shot, but I find to much distraction in the right half of the frame.', '2004-08-13 17:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(858870, 96528, 24642, '<td valign="top">Bold title, cool colors, fresh idea and nice shadows.  Good framing and balance.  This is one of my favorites.  The only thing that distracts me is the shadow in the upper lighter leg.</td>', 'Bold title, cool colors, fresh idea and nice shadows.  Good framing and balance.  This is one of my favorites.  The only thing that distracts me is the shadow in the upper lighter leg.', '2004-08-13 17:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(858871, 96562, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good title. Nice framing.</td>', 'Good title. Nice framing.', '2004-08-13 17:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(858872, 96464, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice form and lighting. There is however some dark distraction on the right side</td>', 'Nice form and lighting. There is however some dark distraction on the right side', '2004-08-13 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(858873, 96411, 2158, '<td valign="top">This shot is crying out for a bit of noise reduction.  I tried neatimage on it and it really looked pretty good.</td>', 'This shot is crying out for a bit of noise reduction.  I tried neatimage on it and it really looked pretty good.', '2004-08-13 17:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(858876, 96545, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good light &amp; shade play.  Good title.</td>', 'Good light & shade play.  Good title.', '2004-08-13 17:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(858882, 95589, 24642, '<td valign="top">I have had a similar shot in my head for many many years but I never found a way to shoot it.  Congrats youv''e done a very good job.  The title is very clever.  This one is one of my favorites.</td>', 'I have had a similar shot in my head for many many years but I never found a way to shoot it.  Congrats youv''e done a very good job.  The title is very clever.  This one is one of my favorites.', '2004-08-13 17:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(858889, 96449, 19322, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition</td>', 'Very nice composition', '2004-08-13 17:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(858891, 96422, 19322, '<td valign="top">Having the jeans in color takes the focus away from the feet.</td>', 'Having the jeans in color takes the focus away from the feet.', '2004-08-13 17:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(858919, 96116, 24642, '<td valign="top">Fab shot.</td>', 'Fab shot.', '2004-08-13 18:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(858947, 96099, 6674, '<td valign="top">Where are the other 2 feet?? Oh, I get it!! <br/></td>', 'Where are the other 2 feet?? Oh, I get it!! ', '2004-08-13 18:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(859033, 95368, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.<br/> <br/>I like the stark contrast of the paving stones with each other. The silouette works very well. The fact that one foot is in motion but not so much creates an emotional link to the man. Based on his body language alone, I can resonate with him. I am sure you will get comments that "feet" really aren''t the subject here, and maybe that''s right. But for me, it''s the best of show this challenge. Congratulations on this powerful image.</td>', 'I love this photo. I like the stark contrast of the paving stones with each other. The silouette works very well. The fact that one foot is in motion but not so much creates an emotional link to the man. Based on his body language alone, I can resonate with him. I am sure you will get comments that "feet" really aren''t the subject here, and maybe that''s right. But for me, it''s the best of show this challenge. Congratulations on this powerful image.', '2004-08-13 19:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(859040, 96465, 18197, '<td valign="top">What a great image. This is just terrific!<br/> <br/>First of all. I like the colors. The do a very nice job conveying the cool temperature of the water. The flow of the water and the background do an excellent job setting context for the photo. The composition suggests that he''s not just cooling tired hot feet, but in fact laying back resting his whole body; that the water is rejuvenating all of him. I have sat with my feet in streams just like this, and felt refreshed just like this. You have done a nice job recreating that experience for me. Thanks.</td>', 'What a great image. This is just terrific! First of all. I like the colors. The do a very nice job conveying the cool temperature of the water. The flow of the water and the background do an excellent job setting context for the photo. The composition suggests that he''s not just cooling tired hot feet, but in fact laying back resting his whole body; that the water is rejuvenating all of him. I have sat with my feet in streams just like this, and felt refreshed just like this. You have done a nice job recreating that experience for me. Thanks.', '2004-08-13 19:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(859041, 95589, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very innovative shot. Composition is very good and conveys a strong relationship between the two. Can''t wait to see how you did it within the rules! Among the best of the challenge.</td>', 'Very innovative shot. Composition is very good and conveys a strong relationship between the two. Can''t wait to see how you did it within the rules! Among the best of the challenge.', '2004-08-13 19:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(859043, 96211, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am not sure I can pinpoint why I like this so much. The focus is good. the contrast is good. Levels are good. Composition is good. But all of that would just make a technically good picture. Somehow the sum of the parts is more and I really like it. Among my top 5 picks for this challenge.</td>', 'I am not sure I can pinpoint why I like this so much. The focus is good. the contrast is good. Levels are good. Composition is good. But all of that would just make a technically good picture. Somehow the sum of the parts is more and I really like it. Among my top 5 picks for this challenge.', '2004-08-13 19:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(859050, 96246, 18197, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this, I thought, what a goofy picture. But the more I looked, the more I liked. First, it is very simple ... elegantly simple in fact. I like the red and the placement of the red bedcover. I am intrigued by what the black might hold. Kate''s eyes are smiling and I suspect she is grinning from ear to ear. An invitation? All the techniques are fine but they add up to a great photo. One of my top 7 picks.</td>', 'When I first looked at this, I thought, what a goofy picture. But the more I looked, the more I liked. First, it is very simple ... elegantly simple in fact. I like the red and the placement of the red bedcover. I am intrigued by what the black might hold. Kate''s eyes are smiling and I suspect she is grinning from ear to ear. An invitation? All the techniques are fine but they add up to a great photo. One of my top 7 picks.', '2004-08-13 19:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(859051, 96233, 18197, '<td valign="top">Sophisticated image. The colors, tones, saturation and levels are really perfect. Hard to imagine how such a simple can convey such emotion.</td>', 'Sophisticated image. The colors, tones, saturation and levels are really perfect. Hard to imagine how such a simple can convey such emotion.', '2004-08-13 19:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(859052, 96536, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well, no one will disagree that it meets the challenge. It seems to be okay technically, possibly a little dark and a few focus issues aside. I guess in the end, I just don'' resonate with the subject.</td>', 'Well, no one will disagree that it meets the challenge. It seems to be okay technically, possibly a little dark and a few focus issues aside. I guess in the end, I just don'' resonate with the subject.', '2004-08-13 19:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(859053, 96536, 25390, '<td valign="top">Nice pose,angle,and it''s metal!great!one of my favourite<br/>!</td>', 'Nice pose,angle,and it''s metal!great!one of my favourite!', '2004-08-13 19:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(859054, 96609, 18197, '<td valign="top">In photos I really like, I feel some emotional response. This leaves me feeling a bit flat. The bright spot is really distracting. Colors seem a bit muddy. I suspect I am completly missing a cultural reference. If I understood it better, I might resonate with this more.</td>', 'In photos I really like, I feel some emotional response. This leaves me feeling a bit flat. The bright spot is really distracting. Colors seem a bit muddy. I suspect I am completly missing a cultural reference. If I understood it better, I might resonate with this more.', '2004-08-13 19:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(859056, 95448, 18197, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling the subject of this photo is actually not in the photo. It would be a better study of the joy of summer to see kids enjoying it (in their eyes, with their smiles). This is interesting as a study of water in motion, but it could have been much more.</td>', 'I have a feeling the subject of this photo is actually not in the photo. It would be a better study of the joy of summer to see kids enjoying it (in their eyes, with their smiles). This is interesting as a study of water in motion, but it could have been much more.', '2004-08-13 19:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(859057, 96534, 18197, '<td valign="top">Maybe just my monitor but this is too dark to see what''s going on.</td>', 'Maybe just my monitor but this is too dark to see what''s going on.', '2004-08-13 19:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(859060, 96605, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well, it meets the challenge. I guess for me feet aren''t that interesting and in the photo you really didn''t grab my attention span and demand of me that they be interesting.</td>', 'Well, it meets the challenge. I guess for me feet aren''t that interesting and in the photo you really didn''t grab my attention span and demand of me that they be interesting.', '2004-08-13 19:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(859063, 96573, 18197, '<td valign="top">Clever idea! Difficult subject to attempt. The bright boxers grab attention from the main(?) subject of the feet.  So it''s difficult to maintain balance and appropriate lighting for the left third of the photo.</td>', 'Clever idea! Difficult subject to attempt. The bright boxers grab attention from the main(?) subject of the feet.  So it''s difficult to maintain balance and appropriate lighting for the left third of the photo.', '2004-08-13 19:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(859083, 96338, 24975, '<td valign="top">Very cute!</td>', 'Very cute!', '2004-08-13 20:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(859166, 96116, 25436, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2004-08-13 21:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(859185, 96556, 20941, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite in this challenge, You have made feet a work of art! That in itself is a great feat!</td>', 'This is my favorite in this challenge, You have made feet a work of art! That in itself is a great feat!', '2004-08-13 22:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(859187, 96517, 20941, '<td valign="top">certainly one of my favorites, great idea, wonderful in b/w!</td>', 'certainly one of my favorites, great idea, wonderful in b/w!', '2004-08-13 22:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(859191, 96566, 20941, '<td valign="top">Great colors, the lightning is perfect, the whole idea is great!</td>', 'Great colors, the lightning is perfect, the whole idea is great!', '2004-08-13 22:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(859192, 96430, 20941, '<td valign="top">Great colors wonderful composition I love it!</td>', 'Great colors wonderful composition I love it!', '2004-08-13 22:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(859301, 96573, 24659, '<td valign="top">Woohoo!  Even people with dorky boxers do get some!</td>', 'Woohoo!  Even people with dorky boxers do get some!', '2004-08-14 01:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
