(859305, 96449, 24659, '<td valign="top">Very small photo, but baby feet are always the best!</td>', 'Very small photo, but baby feet are always the best!', '2004-08-14 01:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(859321, 96566, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites of the challenge. This is so fun to look at. Great job!!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites of the challenge. This is so fun to look at. Great job!!', '2004-08-14 02:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(859323, 95630, 23561, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote in this challenge, but I would give it a 10. I like the pink toenails, they give it just a little pop, not too much. Only possible complaint would be the nail on the big white toe. Looks like it wasn''t clipped straight, but it still adds a bit a character.</td>', 'I can''t vote in this challenge, but I would give it a 10. I like the pink toenails, they give it just a little pop, not too much. Only possible complaint would be the nail on the big white toe. Looks like it wasn''t clipped straight, but it still adds a bit a character.', '2004-08-14 02:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(859330, 96579, 23561, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote but I did want to comment on this. I just kind of thought that the toe nails on the model look like they had a very unprofessional pedicure and that kind of clashes with the very professional and clean looks of the painted foot and the rug. I might have painted the nails a darker color red, closer to that of the carpet. And the foot in the forground is turned a bit on the right side and I can''t see the artwork on the foot clearly even though I want to. IMO</td>', 'I can''t vote but I did want to comment on this. I just kind of thought that the toe nails on the model look like they had a very unprofessional pedicure and that kind of clashes with the very professional and clean looks of the painted foot and the rug. I might have painted the nails a darker color red, closer to that of the carpet. And the foot in the forground is turned a bit on the right side and I can''t see the artwork on the foot clearly even though I want to. IMO', '2004-08-14 02:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(859334, 96599, 23561, '<td valign="top">Cool. I love this. I would love to see a "How did they do that" on this photo.</td>', 'Cool. I love this. I would love to see a "How did they do that" on this photo.', '2004-08-14 02:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(859370, 96505, 20235, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo! The POV, motion blur, composition, and even title are killer. The use of other elements besides "feet" make this really intersting. I''m giving this the only 10 i''ve voted in the whole challenge..... nice work.</td>', 'Awesome photo! The POV, motion blur, composition, and even title are killer. The use of other elements besides "feet" make this really intersting. I''m giving this the only 10 i''ve voted in the whole challenge..... nice work.', '2004-08-14 04:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(859378, 96373, 8759, '<td valign="top">Too dark for my taste. Nice composition 6</td>', 'Too dark for my taste. Nice composition 6', '2004-08-14 04:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(859380, 96527, 8759, '<td valign="top">Colour is someway distracting. Would be better in sepia or b/w. It looks like you used the flash and the reflections are also disturbing. Nice try and good ideea; good use of background</td>', 'Colour is someway distracting. Would be better in sepia or b/w. It looks like you used the flash and the reflections are also disturbing. Nice try and good ideea; good use of background', '2004-08-14 04:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(859383, 96456, 8759, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Good composition and use of the background. In the part of the world I live feet as a measure says nothing. Hard for mr to associate with the challenge. 5 for a good photo!</td>', 'Nice macro. Good composition and use of the background. In the part of the world I live feet as a measure says nothing. Hard for mr to associate with the challenge. 5 for a good photo!', '2004-08-14 04:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(859418, 96453, 6172, '<td valign="top">Great picture, I just feel it missed portaying feet (even in distance)</td>', 'Great picture, I just feel it missed portaying feet (even in distance)', '2004-08-14 07:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(859421, 96430, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, just too much glare. humorous touch with the holes.</td>', 'Nice photo, just too much glare. humorous touch with the holes.', '2004-08-14 07:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(859422, 96314, 18830, '<td valign="top">this is perfect  good luck</td>', 'this is perfect  good luck', '2004-08-14 07:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(859427, 96562, 18450, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!</td>', 'Great shot!!', '2004-08-14 08:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(859428, 95828, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and all white background and shroud...it gives the appearance of death but I assume that with your model''s feet crossed this image is more tongue-in-cheek. Yet, if you read the tag it''s message is sobering and sad (blunt head trauma) and so I think you''re message is kind of confusing.</td>', 'I like the lighting and all white background and shroud...it gives the appearance of death but I assume that with your model''s feet crossed this image is more tongue-in-cheek. Yet, if you read the tag it''s message is sobering and sad (blunt head trauma) and so I think you''re message is kind of confusing.', '2004-08-14 08:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(859431, 96579, 18450, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, a very attractive image........and it isn''t easy to make feet attractive.</td>', 'Lovely colours, a very attractive image........and it isn''t easy to make feet attractive.', '2004-08-14 08:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(859435, 96293, 18450, '<td valign="top">Very strong image, great composition. Love the gritty feel. .Well done! My first 10.</td>', 'Very strong image, great composition. Love the gritty feel. .Well done! My first 10.', '2004-08-14 08:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(859438, 95448, 5822, '<td valign="top">Contrast is good and I like the effect of the backlit splash of water from the stamping of feet and the reflection of light off the water, although, I also think a polorizer may have cut out some of this reflection and improved color saturation and brightness. An interesting photo that meets the challenge well.  Good job.</td>', 'Contrast is good and I like the effect of the backlit splash of water from the stamping of feet and the reflection of light off the water, although, I also think a polorizer may have cut out some of this reflection and improved color saturation and brightness. An interesting photo that meets the challenge well.  Good job.', '2004-08-14 08:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(859442, 96063, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tonal contrasts and textures. Though I believe this to be flash lighting, the effect is very good, especially with the black background that isolates the feet so well.  Very sobering message but very well done.</td>', 'Wonderful tonal contrasts and textures. Though I believe this to be flash lighting, the effect is very good, especially with the black background that isolates the feet so well.  Very sobering message but very well done.', '2004-08-14 08:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(859449, 95827, 5822, '<td valign="top">This picture catched me off guard as I viewed the image I said to myself that this was an ordinary snapshot of two shoes, yet when I discovered the leg prostheses it kind of shocked me and suddenly this image takes on new meaning. Who is above taking the picture and what kind of life do they live? The picture sure has impact and meaning when you realize those shoes are connected to prosthetic legs.</td>', 'This picture catched me off guard as I viewed the image I said to myself that this was an ordinary snapshot of two shoes, yet when I discovered the leg prostheses it kind of shocked me and suddenly this image takes on new meaning. Who is above taking the picture and what kind of life do they live? The picture sure has impact and meaning when you realize those shoes are connected to prosthetic legs.', '2004-08-14 09:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(859454, 95588, 5822, '<td valign="top">Really nice simple composition (love the graceful leaves) and muted colors.</td>', 'Really nice simple composition (love the graceful leaves) and muted colors.', '2004-08-14 09:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(859465, 96373, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this image and the B&amp;W toning.  You''ve captured, in a sense, the self exploratory and discovery of one''s body during youth, yet at the same time, the dirty feet suggest innocence and a non-self consciousness. Love the shapes from the toes up to the broader legs.  Has a classic look and feel. Very very well done.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this image and the B&W toning.  You''ve captured, in a sense, the self exploratory and discovery of one''s body during youth, yet at the same time, the dirty feet suggest innocence and a non-self consciousness. Love the shapes from the toes up to the broader legs.  Has a classic look and feel. Very very well done.', '2004-08-14 09:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(859470, 96504, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the patterns in the sand and how the shadows from the legs cross them.  Sky color is not attractive and a slight distraction is the small toe prints showing next to the left foot. Also, the shadows on the legs seem to be uneven as if you had used fill light on one leg but not the other.</td>', 'Love the patterns in the sand and how the shadows from the legs cross them.  Sky color is not attractive and a slight distraction is the small toe prints showing next to the left foot. Also, the shadows on the legs seem to be uneven as if you had used fill light on one leg but not the other.', '2004-08-14 09:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(859472, 95630, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy apperance and the color desaturation, but think the color could have been more saturated.  Your lighting appears too harsh and uneven and directional and had you used softer light it would improved the color in the nail polish and would have yielded more detail. Still, I like the composition and toning.</td>', 'I like the grainy apperance and the color desaturation, but think the color could have been more saturated.  Your lighting appears too harsh and uneven and directional and had you used softer light it would improved the color in the nail polish and would have yielded more detail. Still, I like the composition and toning.', '2004-08-14 09:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(859475, 96534, 5822, '<td valign="top">Too dark and blurry to really tell what this is.</td>', 'Too dark and blurry to really tell what this is.', '2004-08-14 09:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(859478, 95589, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect that standing on the grating presents as it almost appears your two are floating in air.  Very unique shooting angle that I like very much.  I also like the high-key toning and the way that most of the body on the two people are hazed out except for the feet. Think it could have been improved with some flash light on the soles of the feet, but still a very compelling image.</td>', 'Very cool effect that standing on the grating presents as it almost appears your two are floating in air.  Very unique shooting angle that I like very much.  I also like the high-key toning and the way that most of the body on the two people are hazed out except for the feet. Think it could have been improved with some flash light on the soles of the feet, but still a very compelling image.', '2004-08-14 09:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(859480, 96515, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and exposure and I like the haze effect of the background that gives the impression of depth and distance.  Only the white rock at the bottom of the frame I find to be distracting, but otherwise, nicely done.</td>', 'Nice focus and exposure and I like the haze effect of the background that gives the impression of depth and distance.  Only the white rock at the bottom of the frame I find to be distracting, but otherwise, nicely done.', '2004-08-14 09:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(859481, 96197, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the blurred softness from movement but would have preferred that you use a portrait format to see more of the young boys body to see that you are pushing him up with your feet.  Lighting and toning is good.  Nice compelling image.</td>', 'I like the blurred softness from movement but would have preferred that you use a portrait format to see more of the young boys body to see that you are pushing him up with your feet.  Lighting and toning is good.  Nice compelling image.', '2004-08-14 09:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(859484, 96089, 25448, '<td valign="top">cool combination</td>', 'cool combination', '2004-08-14 09:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(859487, 95574, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but it appears to be some blown out highlights on the foot and leaves.  Did you meter for the skin tones?</td>', 'Nice composition but it appears to be some blown out highlights on the foot and leaves.  Did you meter for the skin tones?', '2004-08-14 09:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(859495, 96507, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very interesting feet...makes me wonder what kind of animal this is.  I think the reflections off the water and mud weakened the color contrast between the yelllow feet/claws.</td>', 'Very interesting feet...makes me wonder what kind of animal this is.  I think the reflections off the water and mud weakened the color contrast between the yelllow feet/claws.', '2004-08-14 10:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(859519, 96515, 164, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the frame  but I do like the  setting.</td>', 'Not sure I like the frame  but I do like the  setting.', '2004-08-14 10:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(859524, 96293, 5822, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a bit off, either from camera movement or subject movement.  I also don''t like the white area in the top right and think you should have cropped that out when you took the picture.  I''m not sure I like the diagnal lines of the bench slats in this context.  Doesn''t fit with the homeless theme youi''re portraying here.  I do, however, like the B&amp;W toning very much.  It appears your subject didn''t know he was being photographed and this kind of candid photography can be difficult.  Really not a bad job overall.</td>', 'Focus seems a bit off, either from camera movement or subject movement.  I also don''t like the white area in the top right and think you should have cropped that out when you took the picture.  I''m not sure I like the diagnal lines of the bench slats in this context.  Doesn''t fit with the homeless theme youi''re portraying here.  I do, however, like the B&W toning very much.  It appears your subject didn''t know he was being photographed and this kind of candid photography can be difficult.  Really not a bad job overall.', '2004-08-14 10:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(859530, 96197, 25449, '<td valign="top">This shows movement and laughter and captures the spirit of childhood for me. Love it.</td>', 'This shows movement and laughter and captures the spirit of childhood for me. Love it.', '2004-08-14 10:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(859534, 96456, 18933, '<td valign="top">not bad -- &lt;smile&gt;</td>', 'not bad -- <smile>', '2004-08-14 11:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(859539, 96545, 18933, '<td valign="top">great contrast</td>', 'great contrast', '2004-08-14 11:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(859540, 96488, 145, '<td valign="top">The missing heads are very distracting - 4</td>', 'The missing heads are very distracting - 4', '2004-08-14 11:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(859542, 96523, 18933, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but imho the focus to not of the feet but on the kid</td>', 'I like the shot but imho the focus to not of the feet but on the kid', '2004-08-14 11:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(859543, 96338, 18933, '<td valign="top">wow and I felt I put up the most ''talked'' about image</td>', 'wow and I felt I put up the most ''talked'' about image', '2004-08-14 11:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(859565, 96583, 25451, '<td valign="top">Very unique ,</td>', 'Very unique ,', '2004-08-14 12:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(859596, 96545, 22734, '<td valign="top">One light source are indeed very impressive studies. However, it is important to control the shadows. Your texture and lighting here are excellent. The only thing I would have done different is to have separeted the right foot enough to clear the stark shadow it leaves on the left. Bumping image from 5 to 6 on visual presentation.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-16 01:19:41.</i></td>', 'One light source are indeed very impressive studies. However, it is important to control the shadows. Your texture and lighting here are excellent. The only thing I would have done different is to have separeted the right foot enough to clear the stark shadow it leaves on the left. Bumping image from 5 to 6 on visual presentation.', '2004-08-14 13:20:34.000000', '2004-08-16 02:19:41.000000', 1),
(859598, 96604, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very good angle and great simplicity of background makes this b/w a wholesome entry to this challenge. It has that lazy feel. Bumping from 5 to 7<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-16 01:43:47.</i></td>', 'Very good angle and great simplicity of background makes this b/w a wholesome entry to this challenge. It has that lazy feel. Bumping from 5 to 7', '2004-08-14 13:24:35.000000', '2004-08-16 02:43:47.000000', 1),
