(859607, 96336, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very cool. very relaxed and that frinks just adds interest. Ah, but to get to it is a major drag. The thought of bringing down my feet to get it, snaps me out of the revery. Bumping from 5 to 7</td>', 'Very cool. very relaxed and that frinks just adds interest. Ah, but to get to it is a major drag. The thought of bringing down my feet to get it, snaps me out of the revery. Bumping from 5 to 7', '2004-08-14 13:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
