(859614, 96292, 22734, '<td valign="top">Ah, yes, almost like praying feet...kidding. The best black and white entry in this challeange. An image with good contrast and rich tones and well focused. Bumping from 5 to 8 and 8 is about my highest.</td>', 'Ah, yes, almost like praying feet...kidding. The best black and white entry in this challeange. An image with good contrast and rich tones and well focused. Bumping from 5 to 8 and 8 is about my highest.', '2004-08-14 13:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
