(859620, 96566, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  The hot area below the shoes is a bit too hot, but apart from that, I like this image a lot!  Nice white and shine in the socks!</td>', 'Very nice!  The hot area below the shoes is a bit too hot, but apart from that, I like this image a lot!  Nice white and shine in the socks!', '2004-08-14 13:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
