(859623, 96063, 10867, '<td valign="top">Great tones and very good choice of subject.</td>', 'Great tones and very good choice of subject.', '2004-08-14 13:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(859625, 95589, 10867, '<td valign="top">Clever and nicely executed.</td>', 'Clever and nicely executed.', '2004-08-14 13:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(859696, 96604, 6405, '<td valign="top">B/w lack of tonality and contrast. Very well perspective.Focus little soft,smaller aperture would help better.6</td>', 'B/w lack of tonality and contrast. Very well perspective.Focus little soft,smaller aperture would help better.6', '2004-08-14 15:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(859697, 96504, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sand texture,legs are distractive element.5</td>', 'Beautiful sand texture,legs are distractive element.5', '2004-08-14 15:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(859699, 96233, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones,10 !</td>', 'Beautiful tones,10 !', '2004-08-14 15:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(859701, 96065, 6405, '<td valign="top">Colors washed out,lack of contrast,soft focus and subject is not interesting.</td>', 'Colors washed out,lack of contrast,soft focus and subject is not interesting.', '2004-08-14 15:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(859702, 96580, 6405, '<td valign="top">You did freeze the action very well,9</td>', 'You did freeze the action very well,9', '2004-08-14 15:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(859706, 96556, 6405, '<td valign="top">Heida? Awesome another 10 from me !</td>', 'Heida? Awesome another 10 from me !', '2004-08-14 15:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(859817, 96223, 8860, '<td valign="top">Now call me an irritation here - but your title belittles this shot. It''s great - and it doesn''t need a comedy caption - well maybe soomething like "Now where''s my E45 cracked heel cream?" or "Pew - smells like I''ve stepped in something.".<br/> <br/>Well captured and I''ll be interested to hear what you did to get so close here. I assume he''s not wild but you never know!</td>', 'Now call me an irritation here - but your title belittles this shot. It''s great - and it doesn''t need a comedy caption - well maybe soomething like "Now where''s my E45 cracked heel cream?" or "Pew - smells like I''ve stepped in something.". Well captured and I''ll be interested to hear what you did to get so close here. I assume he''s not wild but you never know!', '2004-08-14 17:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(859829, 95828, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, good title and neat execution. Detail on tag is a nice touch and of course the twist of the legs crossed is a master stroke. <br/> <br/>My only negatives are: 1. the feet look a little out of shape (sorry) but then I thought - why not? Why the hell does everything have to be just perfect on this site? It could be anyone under there - so that''s now a positive! 2. The overxposure  is just a little to ''styleless'' if you forgive the expression. I''d like to have seen either a more clinical feel to the feet also, or a bit more depth (through some sensitive burning) to darker areas with some higher contrast.<br/> <br/>For me though it''s one of my favourites and I hope it does well (though not too well!!). <br/>; )</td>', 'Nice concept, good title and neat execution. Detail on tag is a nice touch and of course the twist of the legs crossed is a master stroke.  My only negatives are: 1. the feet look a little out of shape (sorry) but then I thought - why not? Why the hell does everything have to be just perfect on this site? It could be anyone under there - so that''s now a positive! 2. The overxposure  is just a little to ''styleless'' if you forgive the expression. I''d like to have seen either a more clinical feel to the feet also, or a bit more depth (through some sensitive burning) to darker areas with some higher contrast. For me though it''s one of my favourites and I hope it does well (though not too well!!). ; )', '2004-08-14 17:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(859835, 96580, 8860, '<td valign="top">While there''s some nice stopped motion here the shot itself does not hold my attention for very long. I also think your freeze had to be absolute - no motion blur at all. your title does not particulalry echo the image for me since it doesn''t look very cold, but more like a soothing bath. Nicely composed.</td>', 'While there''s some nice stopped motion here the shot itself does not hold my attention for very long. I also think your freeze had to be absolute - no motion blur at all. your title does not particulalry echo the image for me since it doesn''t look very cold, but more like a soothing bath. Nicely composed.', '2004-08-14 17:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(859837, 96476, 24659, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, I think it might have liked it even more if the feet were touching the water!!  Good job though.</td>', 'I like the concept, I think it might have liked it even more if the feet were touching the water!!  Good job though.', '2004-08-14 17:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(859838, 96090, 25461, '<td valign="top">It is the closes to life like. I think the black and white does this picture justice. in color it wouldnt have such an apealing effect</td>', 'It is the closes to life like. I think the black and white does this picture justice. in color it wouldnt have such an apealing effect', '2004-08-14 17:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(859841, 96526, 8860, '<td valign="top">This really needed some speed indicated through blur or some sand kicked up to communicate your idea fully. The selection is a useful touch, DOF could have been a touch longer and contrast stronger. Nicely composed otherwise.</td>', 'This really needed some speed indicated through blur or some sand kicked up to communicate your idea fully. The selection is a useful touch, DOF could have been a touch longer and contrast stronger. Nicely composed otherwise.', '2004-08-14 17:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(859843, 95605, 24659, '<td valign="top">Good concept, good photos, vaguely distracted by the girl''s dirty feet... I know, it''s normal, but I think for a dreamy shot like that, she should have cleaner feet.  =)</td>', 'Good concept, good photos, vaguely distracted by the girl''s dirty feet... I know, it''s normal, but I think for a dreamy shot like that, she should have cleaner feet.  =)', '2004-08-14 17:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(859847, 96256, 8860, '<td valign="top">Ooooh - that looks really comfortable. Cats always make me feel relaxed just to look at. And why do we enjoy stroking the darn things - it''s all take, take, take. : )<br/> <br/>This is a good cat shot and I hope you don''t get marked down for it per se. The skewed angle assists the quirky nature of cats and significantly assists this composition. Now give me some of those cute little pink paw pads to squeeze!!...</td>', 'Ooooh - that looks really comfortable. Cats always make me feel relaxed just to look at. And why do we enjoy stroking the darn things - it''s all take, take, take. : ) This is a good cat shot and I hope you don''t get marked down for it per se. The skewed angle assists the quirky nature of cats and significantly assists this composition. Now give me some of those cute little pink paw pads to squeeze!!...', '2004-08-14 17:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(859851, 96603, 5822, '<td valign="top">I find the yellow cast unattractive and the background directly behind the toes distracting. Not an interesting composition. Sorry to be so blunt, but I hope this helps.</td>', 'I find the yellow cast unattractive and the background directly behind the toes distracting. Not an interesting composition. Sorry to be so blunt, but I hope this helps.', '2004-08-14 17:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(859853, 96545, 5822, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition with nice lighting. It appears that it may have been sharpened to excess, though.</td>', 'An interesting composition with nice lighting. It appears that it may have been sharpened to excess, though.', '2004-08-14 17:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(859856, 96465, 8860, '<td valign="top">This has a tangible effect - knowing how that must feel. Nice ''imperfection'' in this with some lovely fluid motion and muted tones. The movement in the trousers is a bit distracting but overall a different, pleasing shot.</td>', 'This has a tangible effect - knowing how that must feel. Nice ''imperfection'' in this with some lovely fluid motion and muted tones. The movement in the trousers is a bit distracting but overall a different, pleasing shot.', '2004-08-14 18:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(859858, 96501, 5822, '<td valign="top">A little too much glare and overexposure from the feet.</td>', 'A little too much glare and overexposure from the feet.', '2004-08-14 18:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(859860, 96556, 8860, '<td valign="top">Your familiar style will doubtless prejudice many voters'' truly objective opinion on this one. : )<br/> <br/>As usual, it''s technically very good, but the title is what the shot relies on for it''s character, more so than the actual subjects. If I remove the title and look at this as an image only, I see an attractive pic (thanks mainly to your post-processing) but some average composition and not particularly evocative subjects. The feet are in the air but they do look so posed that it''s difficult to see past it. <br/> <br/>I would prefer to have seen an action shot of the same idea but with some sand flying up from the movement with the feet frozen in the frame, perhaps panned round to the side and viewed almost as four feet together. This may also have worked with water, although the sand on the soles adds its most interesting feature as it stands.</td>', 'Your familiar style will doubtless prejudice many voters'' truly objective opinion on this one. : ) As usual, it''s technically very good, but the title is what the shot relies on for it''s character, more so than the actual subjects. If I remove the title and look at this as an image only, I see an attractive pic (thanks mainly to your post-processing) but some average composition and not particularly evocative subjects. The feet are in the air but they do look so posed that it''s difficult to see past it.  I would prefer to have seen an action shot of the same idea but with some sand flying up from the movement with the feet frozen in the frame, perhaps panned round to the side and viewed almost as four feet together. This may also have worked with water, although the sand on the soles adds its most interesting feature as it stands.', '2004-08-14 18:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(859861, 96545, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well, there we are - a pair of feet. But what a lovely shot. And it almost makes them look - well, attractive - which, when sifting through the shots in this challenge is actually quite remarkable. <br/> <br/>The white portion to the right of the scene is very distracting though and I would have removed it.</td>', 'Well, there we are - a pair of feet. But what a lovely shot. And it almost makes them look - well, attractive - which, when sifting through the shots in this challenge is actually quite remarkable.  The white portion to the right of the scene is very distracting though and I would have removed it.', '2004-08-14 18:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(859876, 96292, 5822, '<td valign="top">This picture does not say "rest" to me. First, it''s got high contrast and secondly, the composition is built with an overall diagnal and upwards sweep of line. More energetic that of repose. Technically, you have a blown out area smack in the middle of your main subject, the feet. I do however, like the rich black tone.</td>', 'This picture does not say "rest" to me. First, it''s got high contrast and secondly, the composition is built with an overall diagnal and upwards sweep of line. More energetic that of repose. Technically, you have a blown out area smack in the middle of your main subject, the feet. I do however, like the rich black tone.', '2004-08-14 18:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(859877, 96402, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like your use of the wide angle here, but the paw seems to get lost in the rest of the fur and is hard to distinguish. Also, there are two catch lights in the cat''s eye. Finally, I find the background, even though blurred, quite distracting with lines coming out of the cat''s head. I think you should have cropped out this top part and blurred more what was left.  Overall, though, I find this rendition of the cat photos not interesting. Sorry for the harsh critique. I hope it helped.</td>', 'I like your use of the wide angle here, but the paw seems to get lost in the rest of the fur and is hard to distinguish. Also, there are two catch lights in the cat''s eye. Finally, I find the background, even though blurred, quite distracting with lines coming out of the cat''s head. I think you should have cropped out this top part and blurred more what was left.  Overall, though, I find this rendition of the cat photos not interesting. Sorry for the harsh critique. I hope it helped.', '2004-08-14 18:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(859879, 95605, 5822, '<td valign="top">First thing I thought of was what in the world did she step in? Not a pleasant way to be greeted by an image and I''m certainly not thinking of romance anymore after seeing this image.</td>', 'First thing I thought of was what in the world did she step in? Not a pleasant way to be greeted by an image and I''m certainly not thinking of romance anymore after seeing this image.', '2004-08-14 18:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(859880, 96534, 2764, '<td valign="top">uh oh - this is going to suffer from the uncalibrated monitor syndrom.  It is very dak on my lap top, I canonly make out yhr orangr foot in th middle .  White balance adjustment might help in addition to levels and curves.  It seems to orange and too dark.</td>', 'uh oh - this is going to suffer from the uncalibrated monitor syndrom.  It is very dak on my lap top, I canonly make out yhr orangr foot in th middle .  White balance adjustment might help in addition to levels and curves.  It seems to orange and too dark.', '2004-08-14 18:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(859970, 96430, 5822, '<td valign="top">Funny picture with good color and nice and dark background to bring out the bright colors. I like the odd set of socks with the holes in them. Lighting is harsh, but good, as it provides the brightness. Only thing is I think you should have positioned the lighting so that it didn''t cast any shadows, as it did with the red set on the right.</td>', 'Funny picture with good color and nice and dark background to bring out the bright colors. I like the odd set of socks with the holes in them. Lighting is harsh, but good, as it provides the brightness. Only thing is I think you should have positioned the lighting so that it didn''t cast any shadows, as it did with the red set on the right.', '2004-08-14 21:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(859973, 96556, 5822, '<td valign="top">Looks to be heavily processed and I really don''t like the composition.  No blur does not look like falling. Sharpening looks to be excessive, as well.</td>', 'Looks to be heavily processed and I really don''t like the composition.  No blur does not look like falling. Sharpening looks to be excessive, as well.', '2004-08-14 21:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(860041, 96197, 25474, '<td valign="top">That is one good lookin'' kid! Love the pic.</td>', 'That is one good lookin'' kid! Love the pic.', '2004-08-15 01:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(860042, 96486, 1368, '<td valign="top">great composition lighting and the feet in the corner are awesome Great stuff :)</td>', 'great composition lighting and the feet in the corner are awesome Great stuff :)', '2004-08-15 01:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(860102, 96567, 14012, '<td valign="top">would be better if the back foot wasn''t cropped</td>', 'would be better if the back foot wasn''t cropped', '2004-08-15 02:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(860104, 96579, 14012, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been great with a different background</td>', 'I think this would have been great with a different background', '2004-08-15 02:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(860115, 96457, 14012, '<td valign="top">The best I''ve seen yet. I really like the selective desaturation and the way you framed this.</td>', 'The best I''ve seen yet. I really like the selective desaturation and the way you framed this.', '2004-08-15 02:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(860140, 96189, 8860, '<td valign="top">Selective desat is OK, but unnecessary for me. I think you have to give people credit for seeing the feet rather than guiding them there blatantly. <br/> <br/>Had the shoes been crisply focused this technique may have worked better, but the shot is quite soft overall. I''d have left it mono.</td>', 'Selective desat is OK, but unnecessary for me. I think you have to give people credit for seeing the feet rather than guiding them there blatantly.  Had the shoes been crisply focused this technique may have worked better, but the shot is quite soft overall. I''d have left it mono.', '2004-08-15 04:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(860141, 96089, 8860, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a creative idea here, but I have to ask ''why?''. I really do have an open mind to creative shots but this probably falls into the ''I''m gonna shoot some feet in a weird way no matter how odd or ugly it looks'' category!<br/> <br/>For me, what I see is dirty footprints on glass and not much else, although I do appreciate an excellent DOF to get both feet and sky in focus. Composition presents the subject plainly with no other context to assist your title, such as an airplane or something.</td>', 'Now there''s a creative idea here, but I have to ask ''why?''. I really do have an open mind to creative shots but this probably falls into the ''I''m gonna shoot some feet in a weird way no matter how odd or ugly it looks'' category! For me, what I see is dirty footprints on glass and not much else, although I do appreciate an excellent DOF to get both feet and sky in focus. Composition presents the subject plainly with no other context to assist your title, such as an airplane or something.', '2004-08-15 04:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(860142, 96567, 8860, '<td valign="top">There''s a good sense of anticipation here, but it''s odd that you''ve chosen to conceal the very subjects of the challenge theme! Weirdly, I just can''t find much to say about this other than I feel that it''s a bit lacking in interest. I would have given space for more of the player in your composition though as the crop does look stifling.</td>', 'There''s a good sense of anticipation here, but it''s odd that you''ve chosen to conceal the very subjects of the challenge theme! Weirdly, I just can''t find much to say about this other than I feel that it''s a bit lacking in interest. I would have given space for more of the player in your composition though as the crop does look stifling.', '2004-08-15 04:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(860144, 95630, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice idea, good grainy feel to it. Creating a link through the toenail varnish is a nice touch (better than the other attempts here).</td>', 'Good composition, nice idea, good grainy feel to it. Creating a link through the toenail varnish is a nice touch (better than the other attempts here).', '2004-08-15 04:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(860151, 95368, 8860, '<td valign="top">The light and texture from te paving contrast nicely with the figure''s silhouette. Image should have been cropped so that the paving was lined up with the frame and the DOF looks a little shallow. This aside it''s a moody image and, while the feet are subtle, it doesn''t take much effort to establish the connection.</td>', 'The light and texture from te paving contrast nicely with the figure''s silhouette. Image should have been cropped so that the paving was lined up with the frame and the DOF looks a little shallow. This aside it''s a moody image and, while the feet are subtle, it doesn''t take much effort to establish the connection.', '2004-08-15 04:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(860152, 96233, 8860, '<td valign="top">A lovely image in tone and detail. I struggle with the purpose here, but I''m not one for normally having to find reason for artistic freedom! I''d have preferred the subject to be on the far right though to make better use of the ambience of colour and water. This is however my favourite image in the challenge.</td>', 'A lovely image in tone and detail. I struggle with the purpose here, but I''m not one for normally having to find reason for artistic freedom! I''d have preferred the subject to be on the far right though to make better use of the ambience of colour and water. This is however my favourite image in the challenge.', '2004-08-15 04:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(860153, 96504, 8860, '<td valign="top">While the feet and legs here are aesthetically challenged this image certainly meets the theme of this one. The composition is not very engaging although the viewpoint is good. Time should have been taken to straighten the horizon and to consider the purpose of the shot, for which I can see little, apart from the inclusion of feet in a photo. Some other context may help such as something for the person to reach (a boat) or escape from (a crab)!</td>', 'While the feet and legs here are aesthetically challenged this image certainly meets the theme of this one. The composition is not very engaging although the viewpoint is good. Time should have been taken to straighten the horizon and to consider the purpose of the shot, for which I can see little, apart from the inclusion of feet in a photo. Some other context may help such as something for the person to reach (a boat) or escape from (a crab)!', '2004-08-15 04:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(860228, 96506, 16970, '<td valign="top">There is only one FOOT not two or more FEET...  What were you thinking?  LOL If you had a dollor for every comment you got like that :)  <br/> <br/>Now to the real comment.  I love it to bits :)  Great DOF and lighting.  I like the way the frame appears to go behilnd the leg.  Well thought out.  (10)</td>', 'There is only one FOOT not two or more FEET...  What were you thinking?  LOL If you had a dollor for every comment you got like that :)   Now to the real comment.  I love it to bits :)  Great DOF and lighting.  I like the way the frame appears to go behilnd the leg.  Well thought out.  (10)', '2004-08-15 10:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(860265, 96580, 11897, '<td valign="top">Should be a ribbon winner, great picture, well done.</td>', 'Should be a ribbon winner, great picture, well done.', '2004-08-15 11:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(860266, 96492, 11897, '<td valign="top">Hope the train isn''t due :)<br/>Seriously, good picture 9 :same score if it had been vanishing point.</td>', 'Hope the train isn''t due :)Seriously, good picture 9 :same score if it had been vanishing point.', '2004-08-15 11:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(860267, 96507, 11897, '<td valign="top">Splendid shot, hope you do well.</td>', 'Splendid shot, hope you do well.', '2004-08-15 11:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(860277, 96585, 8860, '<td valign="top">This shot seems like it should leave an unanswered question, but although it''s an interesting composition it doesn''t really hold my attention apart from trying to find a reason for it. The shadows are good but there''s really too little else to appeal.</td>', 'This shot seems like it should leave an unanswered question, but although it''s an interesting composition it doesn''t really hold my attention apart from trying to find a reason for it. The shadows are good but there''s really too little else to appeal.', '2004-08-15 11:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(860281, 96064, 8860, '<td valign="top">Never going to win a challenge with a subject like this but I actually find the view interesting. In fact there''s a lot to take in - the signage (with that funny ''hello!'' sign), the casual hanging of once living animals by their feet, and the less than clinical environment it seems to be stored in. It''s good.<br/> <br/>Technically, the whites are a bit blown and the image is a bit small considering how busy it is.</td>', 'Never going to win a challenge with a subject like this but I actually find the view interesting. In fact there''s a lot to take in - the signage (with that funny ''hello!'' sign), the casual hanging of once living animals by their feet, and the less than clinical environment it seems to be stored in. It''s good. Technically, the whites are a bit blown and the image is a bit small considering how busy it is.', '2004-08-15 11:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(860294, 95828, 19959, '<td valign="top">You have obviously taken time and care over this compostion (unless of course you are actually a mortician, in which case get back to work and stop messin'' with the bodys!) This picture works very well, the label is key to the success I think. Well done, deserves to do very well</td>', 'You have obviously taken time and care over this compostion (unless of course you are actually a mortician, in which case get back to work and stop messin'' with the bodys!) This picture works very well, the label is key to the success I think. Well done, deserves to do very well', '2004-08-15 12:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(860295, 95688, 19959, '<td valign="top">Hmm... Luck no-one came along and stole the camera!</td>', 'Hmm... Luck no-one came along and stole the camera!', '2004-08-15 12:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(860296, 95803, 19959, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and good selective de-saturation</td>', 'Nice detail and good selective de-saturation', '2004-08-15 12:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(860297, 96402, 19959, '<td valign="top">Arghhh another cat photo...!! Nice though... I''d have done the same (my wife won''t pose for me and my feet a are simply hideous!!)</td>', 'Arghhh another cat photo...!! Nice though... I''d have done the same (my wife won''t pose for me and my feet a are simply hideous!!)', '2004-08-15 12:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
