(860587, 96256, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is such a cute kitty and good paws (feet).  If it was mine, I''d probably try for a little more depth of field to show off that pretty face, and maybe not have it tilted quite so much.  Still, I can tell you and kit had fun taking the picture.</td>', 'This is such a cute kitty and good paws (feet).  If it was mine, I''d probably try for a little more depth of field to show off that pretty face, and maybe not have it tilted quite so much.  Still, I can tell you and kit had fun taking the picture.', '2004-08-15 20:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
