(860876, 96233, 7322, '<td valign="top">I really liked the mood and character of this shot. It works as art outside the concept of the challenge. Lovely.<br/>Should have been a ribbon winner.</td>', 'I really liked the mood and character of this shot. It works as art outside the concept of the challenge. Lovely.Should have been a ribbon winner.', '2004-08-16 01:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(860884, 96580, 22734, '<td valign="top">Hey Eddie: A big and loud congratulations on "It''s freezing!" taking the blue. I notice you colored it the color of the ribbon you earned.<br/>It is a clear and slick image with great water movement and of course, the great EddyG lighting and the extra wet, almost oil like high glitter of the feet. A great water action shot with that cool effervescent dispersion. A great addition to any port. <br/></td>', 'Hey Eddie: A big and loud congratulations on "It''s freezing!" taking the blue. I notice you colored it the color of the ribbon you earned.It is a clear and slick image with great water movement and of course, the great EddyG lighting and the extra wet, almost oil like high glitter of the feet. A great water action shot with that cool effervescent dispersion. A great addition to any port. ', '2004-08-16 01:43:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(860896, 96556, 17851, '<td valign="top">congrats!!! im glad u ribboned!!</td>', 'congrats!!! im glad u ribboned!!', '2004-08-16 01:49:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(860900, 96599, 22734, '<td valign="top">Scalvert: I am jumping for joy on your behalf. Man, are you good ! I am so proud of you and so very happy for you. A super idea and very well executed. Above all, a most interesting image with multi-level rings of nuances. A smashing and oustanding accomplishment back to back with your Home, Sweet Hole.<br/> <br/>You see, when you have talent it just has to come out. <br/> <br/>Congratulations on your blue and open the champagne and now your wife will say, "Honey, I thought you were crazy... but hey, you are my genius"</td>', 'Scalvert: I am jumping for joy on your behalf. Man, are you good ! I am so proud of you and so very happy for you. A super idea and very well executed. Above all, a most interesting image with multi-level rings of nuances. A smashing and oustanding accomplishment back to back with your Home, Sweet Hole. You see, when you have talent it just has to come out.  Congratulations on your blue and open the champagne and now your wife will say, "Honey, I thought you were crazy... but hey, you are my genius"', '2004-08-16 01:53:20.000000', NULL, 0),
