(861200, 96522, 9232, '<td valign="top">I think this was a cool idea for this challenge.  I like the concept and about 1/2 of the execution but I can see how more people like the shoes to be behind the feet.  I also see how the lighting would have benefitted from a barndoor to direct the light off the upper legs and let them blend into darker obscurity.<br/> <br/>My original intent was to place emphasis on the feet by having them silhouetted.  I wanted to add "texture" to the photo by bringing out the "weave" in the pantyhose.  <br/> <br/>Regardless, I think I can see what others seemed to like and what they didn''t and I don''t think I would be giving up any of what I like in the shot to adjust the composition and lighting just a little and try to make this more appealing.  I''m enjoying working with lighting.  This shoot was fun.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments and votes.<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'I think this was a cool idea for this challenge.  I like the concept and about 1/2 of the execution but I can see how more people like the shoes to be behind the feet.  I also see how the lighting would have benefitted from a barndoor to direct the light off the upper legs and let them blend into darker obscurity. My original intent was to place emphasis on the feet by having them silhouetted.  I wanted to add "texture" to the photo by bringing out the "weave" in the pantyhose.   Regardless, I think I can see what others seemed to like and what they didn''t and I don''t think I would be giving up any of what I like in the shot to adjust the composition and lighting just a little and try to make this more appealing.  I''m enjoying working with lighting.  This shoot was fun. Thanks for the comments and votes. Kev', '2004-08-16 07:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
