(861875, 96599, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hey, if painting models is good enough for kiwiness, who am I to argue? Thanks for your comments everybody!<br/> <br/>I must admit I''m a little embarrassed that this won. The light is really flat (overcast day), the foot position is awkward, and I could have done a more realistic job with painting seams, etc., but 6-year-old models aren''t very patient. I suppose missing the blue by .002 is fair punishment. ;-)</td>', 'Hey, if painting models is good enough for kiwiness, who am I to argue? Thanks for your comments everybody! I must admit I''m a little embarrassed that this won. The light is really flat (overcast day), the foot position is awkward, and I could have done a more realistic job with painting seams, etc., but 6-year-old models aren''t very patient. I suppose missing the blue by .002 is fair punishment. ;-)', '2004-08-16 16:26:50.000000', NULL, 0),
