(975220, 96063, 28108, '<td valign="top">Ok... First I was amazed by your "Tricolor Lisa" and then I see this picture, not only is it great, but that was my idea for the "poverty challenge"... No hard feelings (I''m too late for the challenge anyway), again, real nice work!</td>', 'Ok... First I was amazed by your "Tricolor Lisa" and then I see this picture, not only is it great, but that was my idea for the "poverty challenge"... No hard feelings (I''m too late for the challenge anyway), again, real nice work!', '2004-10-26 23:59:26.000000', NULL, 0),
