(1297736, 96505, 17937, '<td valign="top">Really great photo.  I had no idea how you did this until I read your comments.  I like how you told your neighbors how you were shooting for a magazine.  I know my neighbors look at me weird sometimes too.  Great job though.  Marked uo as a new favorite for me.</td>', 'Really great photo.  I had no idea how you did this until I read your comments.  I like how you told your neighbors how you were shooting for a magazine.  I know my neighbors look at me weird sometimes too.  Great job though.  Marked uo as a new favorite for me.', '2005-04-17 11:15:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1403274, 95368, 14986, '<td valign="top">Yeah...this one has more comments already, but I wanted to say how much I really like the way this makes the viewer wonder what''s going on.  Nicely composed and perfect exposure.</td>', 'Yeah...this one has more comments already, but I wanted to say how much I really like the way this makes the viewer wonder what''s going on.  Nicely composed and perfect exposure.', '2005-05-22 00:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1459297, 96505, 27763, '<td valign="top">This is incredible.  What''s even more incredible is that it''s not a studio shot: you actually strapped a camera to your skateboard and road it around.  I am very very impressed.</td>', 'This is incredible.  What''s even more incredible is that it''s not a studio shot: you actually strapped a camera to your skateboard and road it around.  I am very very impressed.', '2005-06-15 22:51:53.000000', NULL, 0),
